(78565, 2776, 2172, '<td valign="top">Cool photo.  Made me chuckle.  I don''t want to ''pare'' it apart, but just two things:  the white could''ve been whiter and the reflection of the ends of the sturdyboard are too ap''pare''nt.  Would''ve been more effective with larger sturdyboard. I had trouble wth the white balance as well and didn''t even realize it until someone pointed it out to me.<br/>Creative idea.  Nice work.<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Cool photo.  Made me chuckle.  I don''t want to ''pare'' it apart, but just two things:  the white could''ve been whiter and the reflection of the ends of the sturdyboard are too ap''pare''nt.  Would''ve been more effective with larger sturdyboard. I had trouble wth the white balance as well and didn''t even realize it until someone pointed it out to me.Creative idea.  Nice work.Ruthann', '2002-07-01 23:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
