(78655, 2779, 1005, '<td valign="top">Slightly contraversial in US, (kid/alcohol combo), but a well taken, interesting shot.  The left side of this shot hurts the overall effect and the squarish reflection under the kid''s eye is a minus, too.  I do like how the beer bubbles appear like stars.<br/>Photo 6 Transparency 7 total 7 swash</td>', 'Slightly contraversial in US, (kid/alcohol combo), but a well taken, interesting shot.  The left side of this shot hurts the overall effect and the squarish reflection under the kid''s eye is a minus, too.  I do like how the beer bubbles appear like stars.Photo 6 Transparency 7 total 7 swash', '2002-07-03 15:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78656, 2779, 806, '<td valign="top">Cute. Good photo. (8) Playing with the title in my head. How about "Pint Sized". Describes the Ale and Child. Just a quirky thought.</td>', 'Cute. Good photo. (8) Playing with the title in my head. How about "Pint Sized". Describes the Ale and Child. Just a quirky thought.', '2002-07-03 17:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
