(78661, 2779, 811, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, and I like the kid''s smile.  Could the brightness on the left side have been eliminated by using a less direct source of light, or could you have taken a higher res picture and cropped it off?  It really detracts from the quality of this picture.  Also, (and this is just a personal thing) the coupling of a child and beer (even if non-alc) bothers me.  Why not Mountain Dew, or Kool-Aid? karmat</td>', 'Nice idea, and I like the kid''s smile.  Could the brightness on the left side have been eliminated by using a less direct source of light, or could you have taken a higher res picture and cropped it off?  It really detracts from the quality of this picture.  Also, (and this is just a personal thing) the coupling of a child and beer (even if non-alc) bothers me.  Why not Mountain Dew, or Kool-Aid? karmat', '2002-07-06 11:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78662, 2779, 1031, '<td valign="top">I''m wondering how many "pints" it took to complete the project. If you crop it square (or round) you''ll have an archetypical "smiley face" image -- maybe you can sell it to them for a print ad.</td>', 'I''m wondering how many "pints" it took to complete the project. If you crop it square (or round) you''ll have an archetypical "smiley face" image -- maybe you can sell it to them for a print ad.', '2002-07-06 19:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78663, 2779, 2221, '<td valign="top">very nice! i like it a lot. beautiful colors. a bit overexposured on the left side but i think it only adds to the general distortion so it''s ok in this case.<br/>i also like the setting very much. looks like the child is amazed by the bubbles ;-)</td>', 'very nice! i like it a lot. beautiful colors. a bit overexposured on the left side but i think it only adds to the general distortion so it''s ok in this case.i also like the setting very much. looks like the child is amazed by the bubbles ;-)', '2002-07-06 22:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
