(78665, 2779, 806, '<td valign="top">I wasn''t thinking this meant children should drink. Guess I was more caught up with the distortion effect, and the transparency and color of the ale. Sure, maybe others are right - if you were going to sell it to an add campaign, but I don''t think that was your intention. Anyway, it doesn''t deserve a placement of 84. Ah well.</td>', 'I wasn''t thinking this meant children should drink. Guess I was more caught up with the distortion effect, and the transparency and color of the ale. Sure, maybe others are right - if you were going to sell it to an add campaign, but I don''t think that was your intention. Anyway, it doesn''t deserve a placement of 84. Ah well.', '2002-07-08 09:46:00.000000', NULL, 0),
