(78724, 2790, 2474, '<td valign="top">This one caught my eye instantly, and it''s great in b/w because the colors don''t spoil the lovely imagery here.  Great work, it has my vote!</td>', 'This one caught my eye instantly, and it''s great in b/w because the colors don''t spoil the lovely imagery here.  Great work, it has my vote!', '2002-07-01 03:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78725, 2790, 2323, '<td valign="top">Very nice in black and white!  Is that supposed to me a message in a bottle?</td>', 'Very nice in black and white!  Is that supposed to me a message in a bottle?', '2002-07-01 08:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78726, 2790, 1037, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the black and white works well. It''s too low contrast and grey. Some vibrancy in the colours would lift this photo a lot, eg. vivid blue or turquoise.</td>', 'I don''t think the black and white works well. It''s too low contrast and grey. Some vibrancy in the colours would lift this photo a lot, eg. vivid blue or turquoise.', '2002-07-01 10:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78727, 2790, 1897, '<td valign="top">A little bland.  I do not like the shade and lack if sharpness in the top of the stick</td>', 'A little bland.  I do not like the shade and lack if sharpness in the top of the stick', '2002-07-01 12:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78728, 2790, 1831, '<td valign="top">IMO.I think the bottle gets lost in B&amp;W. Would of prefered colour. Nice picture tho"7".Dogman.</td>', 'IMO.I think the bottle gets lost in B&W. Would of prefered colour. Nice picture tho"7".Dogman.', '2002-07-01 13:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78729, 2790, 2172, '<td valign="top">Looks good.  I like the softness of the water.  Yet, maybe could''ve used a little touch of color - one thing, like a red pebble or something blue - bright - or something in the bottle - Just and Idea.    Technically good photo.  Great job!</td>', 'Looks good.  I like the softness of the water.  Yet, maybe could''ve used a little touch of color - one thing, like a red pebble or something blue - bright - or something in the bottle - Just and Idea.    Technically good photo.  Great job!', '2002-07-01 13:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78730, 2790, 1569, '<td valign="top">I think this needed to be in color to be efective,can''t really tell if there is a message in there or not,really have to look hard to see it.</td>', 'I think this needed to be in color to be efective,can''t really tell if there is a message in there or not,really have to look hard to see it.', '2002-07-01 13:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78731, 2790, 1779, '<td valign="top">nice... : )</td>', 'nice... : )', '2002-07-01 14:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78732, 2790, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very well shot, low interest value, maybe it''s too grey, lacking contrast.  Photo 9 Transparency 6 total 8 swash</td>', 'Very well shot, low interest value, maybe it''s too grey, lacking contrast.  Photo 9 Transparency 6 total 8 swash', '2002-07-01 15:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78733, 2790, 2494, '<td valign="top">this looks like it would have been fun to do in the back yard pool.</td>', 'this looks like it would have been fun to do in the back yard pool.', '2002-07-01 16:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78734, 2790, 2152, '<td valign="top">I wish there was more contrast here... somewhere.  I still like the shot, though.</td>', 'I wish there was more contrast here... somewhere.  I still like the shot, though.', '2002-07-01 16:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78735, 2790, 327, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, well done. Kee</td>', 'Very nice shot, well done. Kee', '2002-07-01 19:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78736, 2790, 133, '<td valign="top">a nice black and white</td>', 'a nice black and white', '2002-07-01 19:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78737, 2790, 1759, '<td valign="top">Nice clean shot.</td>', 'Nice clean shot.', '2002-07-01 19:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78738, 2790, 2079, '<td valign="top">semi-transparent -10<br/>distortion - 10<br/>colors in objects - 0<br/>Be creative - 7<br/></td>', 'semi-transparent -10distortion - 10colors in objects - 0Be creative - 7', '2002-07-02 03:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78739, 2790, 2382, '<td valign="top">nice play on light.</td>', 'nice play on light.', '2002-07-02 15:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78740, 2790, 1856, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  Seems to need a tad more contrast.  This looks more like it was taken in a bathtub than on a beach.  I would also allow for more room above the bottle top in the crop.  6</td>', 'Good idea.  Seems to need a tad more contrast.  This looks more like it was taken in a bathtub than on a beach.  I would also allow for more room above the bottle top in the crop.  6', '2002-07-03 10:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78741, 2790, 1944, '<td valign="top">A good idea and a interesting interpertation of the challange. It might have been nicer if you had had more contrast. It would have given the image more power.</td>', 'A good idea and a interesting interpertation of the challange. It might have been nicer if you had had more contrast. It would have given the image more power.', '2002-07-03 14:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78742, 2790, 1313, '<td valign="top">Would have been better with some crisp colors.</td>', 'Would have been better with some crisp colors.', '2002-07-03 22:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78743, 2790, 637, '<td valign="top">Viewing the water through the bottle doesn''t add anything to the image.  3 sjgleah</td>', 'Viewing the water through the bottle doesn''t add anything to the image.  3 sjgleah', '2002-07-04 00:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78744, 2790, 772, '<td valign="top">I like this transparency... I think it works nicely but I am wondering if there would have been a way to offer some more contrast.  I''m also wondering why you chose black and white?  Good work :) = 8 - jmsetzler</td>', 'I like this transparency... I think it works nicely but I am wondering if there would have been a way to offer some more contrast.  I''m also wondering why you chose black and white?  Good work :) = 8 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-05 01:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78745, 2790, 509, '<td valign="top">I wish there was more contrast in this picture (btw, how did it look in color? I imagine it would have worked either way).  Nevertheless, this is one of my favorites this round.  The smoothness of the water and the slight turbulence makes this an appealing shot.  Nice job! - 9</td>', 'I wish there was more contrast in this picture (btw, how did it look in color? I imagine it would have worked either way).  Nevertheless, this is one of my favorites this round.  The smoothness of the water and the slight turbulence makes this an appealing shot.  Nice job! - 9', '2002-07-05 16:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78746, 2790, 811, '<td valign="top">I like this in black and white, it helps you to see the simplicity and transparency of the shot, but I also wonder what it would look like in color.  Bright vibrant colors.  Blue for the water and orange for the stopper, for example. karmat</td>', 'I like this in black and white, it helps you to see the simplicity and transparency of the shot, but I also wonder what it would look like in color.  Bright vibrant colors.  Blue for the water and orange for the stopper, for example. karmat', '2002-07-06 13:44:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(78747, 2790, 2188, '<td valign="top">Very nice.Lots of water action really makes this shot.</td>', 'Very nice.Lots of water action really makes this shot.', '2002-07-06 23:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78748, 2790, 1054, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  I like the double-application of the theme.</td>', 'Nicely done.  I like the double-application of the theme.', '2002-07-07 11:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78749, 2790, 2221, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo. I like how the sun light reflects in the water. Maybe a litte lesser DOF would be better. Some parts e.g. the water in the bottom right corner and the top of the bottle are blurred. But that''s the opposite of the crystal clearness which the photo shows (as far as I see it).</td>', 'Very nice photo. I like how the sun light reflects in the water. Maybe a litte lesser DOF would be better. Some parts e.g. the water in the bottom right corner and the top of the bottle are blurred. But that''s the opposite of the crystal clearness which the photo shows (as far as I see it).', '2002-07-07 22:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78750, 2790, 2109, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the negative comments... and thanks for the positive ones too.<br/><br/>For those that made mention of color, the color version really sucked. Trust me, its a much better shot in B&amp;W.<br/><br/>Lisa -- Yes, it was taken in a bath tub... on purpose.<br/><br/>indigo997 -- No, its not cropped too tight.  You''re looking at the edges of the photograph!  Out of 35 shots, this was the only one with the entire bottle in the photograph.  In all the others, the bottle kept floating out of view before I could hit the shutter ;)<br/><br/>lisae -- yes, its supposed to be low contrast.  Its "transparent".  Thanks.<br/><br/>sjgleah -- transparency was the challenge.<br/><br/><br/></td>', 'Thanks for all the negative comments... and thanks for the positive ones too.For those that made mention of color, the color version really sucked. Trust me, its a much better shot in B&W.Lisa -- Yes, it was taken in a bath tub... on purpose.indigo997 -- No, its not cropped too tight.  You''re looking at the edges of the photograph!  Out of 35 shots, this was the only one with the entire bottle in the photograph.  In all the others, the bottle kept floating out of view before I could hit the shutter ;)lisae -- yes, its supposed to be low contrast.  Its "transparent".  Thanks.sjgleah -- transparency was the challenge.', '2002-07-08 09:27:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(78751, 2791, 1202, '<td valign="top">I am fascinated with the refracted ligh of the CD also and have been experimenting with the "great shot " of them.   The center always distracts the great colors for me also, if we get that figured out it will be great.</td>', 'I am fascinated with the refracted ligh of the CD also and have been experimenting with the "great shot " of them.   The center always distracts the great colors for me also, if we get that figured out it will be great.', '2002-07-01 10:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78752, 2791, 2000, '<td valign="top">Not sure the blades on the fan add anything to this picture, as the metallic parts detract from the focus at the center of the CD</td>', 'Not sure the blades on the fan add anything to this picture, as the metallic parts detract from the focus at the center of the CD', '2002-07-01 11:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78753, 2791, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a unique entry this week but.... without the title, I would have no clue as to what i''m looking at with the exception of the CD.  The title is explaining this photo to the viewer.  Photos should really stand on their own, as stated in the rules of the site.  = 4 - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is a unique entry this week but.... without the title, I would have no clue as to what i''m looking at with the exception of the CD.  The title is explaining this photo to the viewer.  Photos should really stand on their own, as stated in the rules of the site.  = 4 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-01 13:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78754, 2791, 1569, '<td valign="top">This is neat--I think the fan should be off. I didn''t know it was a fan except for the title.</td>', 'This is neat--I think the fan should be off. I didn''t know it was a fan except for the title.', '2002-07-01 13:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78755, 2791, 1759, '<td valign="top">Yet another col effect using a CD!  On the downside, I notice that the finger showing and the lighting at the bottom are a bit distractive and take away from the symmetry.</td>', 'Yet another col effect using a CD!  On the downside, I notice that the finger showing and the lighting at the bottom are a bit distractive and take away from the symmetry.', '2002-07-01 14:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78756, 2791, 2146, '<td valign="top">need to keep an eye on your reflections...nice pic though</td>', 'need to keep an eye on your reflections...nice pic though', '2002-07-01 14:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78757, 2791, 1880, '<td valign="top">Illuminating ....</td>', 'Illuminating ....', '2002-07-01 20:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78758, 2791, 1005, '<td valign="top">nice shot, but kinda limited window for the transparency part.  I like the colors created on the surface of the CD ROM, but it''s hard to see what is going on behind the CD, from the reflections on the front of the CD.  (follow me?)<br/>Photo 8 Transparency 7 total 7 swash</td>', 'nice shot, but kinda limited window for the transparency part.  I like the colors created on the surface of the CD ROM, but it''s hard to see what is going on behind the CD, from the reflections on the front of the CD.  (follow me?)Photo 8 Transparency 7 total 7 swash', '2002-07-02 18:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78759, 2791, 2337, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept.  The reflected camera even worked for me.  But the finger on the bottom kind of ruined it for me.</td>', 'Interesting concept.  The reflected camera even worked for me.  But the finger on the bottom kind of ruined it for me.', '2002-07-03 18:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78760, 2791, 705, '<td valign="top">Glad you told me that''s a ceiling fan.  Glare on CD surface is detrimental-draws the eye too much.</td>', 'Glad you told me that''s a ceiling fan.  Glare on CD surface is detrimental-draws the eye too much.', '2002-07-03 18:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78761, 2791, 1031, '<td valign="top">I think I''d crop top and bottom to get the finger out.</td>', 'I think I''d crop top and bottom to get the finger out.', '2002-07-06 02:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78762, 2791, 1054, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what that bright light at the bottom of the frame is, bit I find that pulls my attention away from the main part of thie shot.  Also the reflection of the monitor in the CDR is distracting.</td>', 'I''m not sure what that bright light at the bottom of the frame is, bit I find that pulls my attention away from the main part of thie shot.  Also the reflection of the monitor in the CDR is distracting.', '2002-07-07 10:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78763, 2791, 1, '<td valign="top">A decent idea, poorly executed.  I see what I assume is your thumb holding the CD up.  Maybe hang it from the fan with a few strings, or something that''s not distracting.</td>', 'A decent idea, poorly executed.  I see what I assume is your thumb holding the CD up.  Maybe hang it from the fan with a few strings, or something that''s not distracting.', '2002-07-07 23:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78764, 2791, 2221, '<td valign="top">wanted to do a shot with a cd, too. but i failed because they aren''t _that_ transparent.<br/>yours is much better :-) i especially like the corona like colors around the cd. but maybe you should have turned off your computer screen ;-)<br/></td>', 'wanted to do a shot with a cd, too. but i failed because they aren''t _that_ transparent.yours is much better :-) i especially like the corona like colors around the cd. but maybe you should have turned off your computer screen ;-)', '2002-07-07 23:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78765, 2794, 714, '<td valign="top">creative 5 interesting 3 focus 3 framing 6= 4</td>', 'creative 5 interesting 3 focus 3 framing 6= 4', '2002-07-01 01:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78766, 2794, 1, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and color, I just wish there was more detail (focus / blur ?).</td>', 'Great lighting and color, I just wish there was more detail (focus / blur ?).', '2002-07-01 09:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78767, 2794, 436, '<td valign="top">I liked this beter as a thumbnail. The light''s action within the dice is very interesting.  I personally don''t care for the texture in front.</td>', 'I liked this beter as a thumbnail. The light''s action within the dice is very interesting.  I personally don''t care for the texture in front.', '2002-07-01 11:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78768, 2794, 1175, '<td valign="top">Focus is a bit soft.</td>', 'Focus is a bit soft.', '2002-07-01 12:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78769, 2794, 2363, '<td valign="top">A bit out of focus</td>', 'A bit out of focus', '2002-07-01 12:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78770, 2794, 2000, '<td valign="top">The lighting here seems to make an eclipse effect on that which the die is sitting on.  Kind of reminds me of a Borg Cube (from Star Trek).</td>', 'The lighting here seems to make an eclipse effect on that which the die is sitting on.  Kind of reminds me of a Borg Cube (from Star Trek).', '2002-07-01 13:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78771, 2794, 705, '<td valign="top">a bit blurry.  great set up and lighting.  good choice of subject.  good framing.</td>', 'a bit blurry.  great set up and lighting.  good choice of subject.  good framing.', '2002-07-01 16:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78772, 2794, 327, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, well done. Kee</td>', 'Very nice shot, well done. Kee', '2002-07-01 19:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78773, 2794, 772, '<td valign="top">The concept on this photo is excellent.  In my personal preference, I don''t care for single subject photos where the subject is bullseye centered in the frame.  The focus is a little too soft in this photo as well... = 5 - jmsetzler</td>', 'The concept on this photo is excellent.  In my personal preference, I don''t care for single subject photos where the subject is bullseye centered in the frame.  The focus is a little too soft in this photo as well... = 5 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-02 13:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78774, 2794, 1005, '<td valign="top">Coolly wierd.  I see it now.  Nice tricks of lighting.  Well executed shot.  Photo 9 Transparency 8 total 9 swash</td>', 'Coolly wierd.  I see it now.  Nice tricks of lighting.  Well executed shot.  Photo 9 Transparency 8 total 9 swash', '2002-07-02 15:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78775, 2794, 1759, '<td valign="top">Good composition and a nice job on lighting the cube, however, the focus is really a bit too soft and brightness in front shows too much of the texture from the backdrop.</td>', 'Good composition and a nice job on lighting the cube, however, the focus is really a bit too soft and brightness in front shows too much of the texture from the backdrop.', '2002-07-02 20:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78776, 2794, 1379, '<td valign="top">I love your lighting on this!</td>', 'I love your lighting on this!', '2002-07-02 23:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78777, 2794, 1944, '<td valign="top">A good use of transparency and focusing the light on the foreground. My only suggestion would be to have the back of the die in sharp focus. If the whole lighted part were starkly, sharply in focus this picture would have been a 9.</td>', 'A good use of transparency and focusing the light on the foreground. My only suggestion would be to have the back of the die in sharp focus. If the whole lighted part were starkly, sharply in focus this picture would have been a 9.', '2002-07-03 20:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
