(78785, 2795, 1202, '<td valign="top">Too bad we can''t all have models like "Keeping in The Freshness".   Barbie will just have to do, but why did you cover up her face?</td>', 'Too bad we can''t all have models like "Keeping in The Freshness".   Barbie will just have to do, but why did you cover up her face?', '2002-07-01 11:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
