(78788, 2795, 1041, '<td valign="top">hm.  i guess technically this is a good photo.  composition is ok, it''s in focus, not too dark or too light.  i also see your point of humor, but somehow the picture doesn''t grab me and i''m trying to figure out why.  maybe it''s because the wrap (can''t remember the brand name) is kind of used as clothing, but not really.  one arm is wrapped in, the other almost tied up in the air.  i guess it looks a little haphazardous to me.  but then, that''s just my opinion, other''s may be thrilled and may get it more.  (gr8photos - 3).</td>', 'hm.  i guess technically this is a good photo.  composition is ok, it''s in focus, not too dark or too light.  i also see your point of humor, but somehow the picture doesn''t grab me and i''m trying to figure out why.  maybe it''s because the wrap (can''t remember the brand name) is kind of used as clothing, but not really.  one arm is wrapped in, the other almost tied up in the air.  i guess it looks a little haphazardous to me.  but then, that''s just my opinion, other''s may be thrilled and may get it more.  (gr8photos - 3).', '2002-07-01 15:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
