(78790, 2795, 705, '<td valign="top">clever.  can''t figure out why she''s got her face wrapped.  confusing shadows.  I know saran wrap is transparent....but it''s not being played up here.</td>', 'clever.  can''t figure out why she''s got her face wrapped.  confusing shadows.  I know saran wrap is transparent....but it''s not being played up here.', '2002-07-01 16:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
