(78870, 2803, 1519, '<td valign="top">This turned out really cool!! I just realized that there are only 2 people in this photo! Woah! That''s awesome! Great job! I thought about trying something like this, but couldn''t come up with a good composition... Nice work! A 9!  I think maybe a different location could have been a 10 for me.</td>', 'This turned out really cool!! I just realized that there are only 2 people in this photo! Woah! That''s awesome! Great job! I thought about trying something like this, but couldn''t come up with a good composition... Nice work! A 9!  I think maybe a different location could have been a 10 for me.', '2002-07-03 10:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
