(78883, 2803, 1779, '<td valign="top">Very col pic. One of my personal favorites for this challenge. Questions: Are the guys in the back the same ones as the ones in the front? did you use a glass?<br/><br/>share! <br/><br/>LM</td>', 'Very col pic. One of my personal favorites for this challenge. Questions: Are the guys in the back the same ones as the ones in the front? did you use a glass?share! LM', '2002-07-08 11:40:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(78884, 2803, 2140, '<td valign="top">thats me with the silly green hat and my bro with the black and white jumper. i didn''t use any glass or composite imaging for this picture. I used a 16 second exposure, we posed for the ones where you can see our faces first, holding very still for about 7 seconds then quickly moving to our next position (looking at the moon) and remained there until the 16 seconds finished.</td>', 'thats me with the silly green hat and my bro with the black and white jumper. i didn''t use any glass or composite imaging for this picture. I used a 16 second exposure, we posed for the ones where you can see our faces first, holding very still for about 7 seconds then quickly moving to our next position (looking at the moon) and remained there until the 16 seconds finished.', '2002-07-08 13:00:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(78885, 2803, 1779, '<td valign="top">that''s what I thought but I discarded the idea because I saw the hole place to illuminated (and the moon) and though that  if you would''ve done it that way the movement would show. I guess the night was not as illuminated as it looks and it gave you a chance to move without been captured. Congrats again.  For this challenge (fear) I did something with long exposure too, hope you like it.<br/><br/>LM</td>', 'that''s what I thought but I discarded the idea because I saw the hole place to illuminated (and the moon) and though that  if you would''ve done it that way the movement would show. I guess the night was not as illuminated as it looks and it gave you a chance to move without been captured. Congrats again.  For this challenge (fear) I did something with long exposure too, hope you like it.LM', '2002-07-08 13:37:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(78886, 2803, 2172, '<td valign="top">Congrats on 5th!  This was a very interesting and great shot!</td>', 'Congrats on 5th!  This was a very interesting and great shot!', '2002-07-08 13:38:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(78887, 2803, 2140, '<td valign="top">the trick to not seeing the movement is to use a longer exposure, less lighting, wear darker clothing and move really fast.</td>', 'the trick to not seeing the movement is to use a longer exposure, less lighting, wear darker clothing and move really fast.', '2002-07-08 23:03:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(78888, 2803, 3402, '<td valign="top">wow.  this is a great shot.  did you do a double exposure?  please email me with technic...cmcvety@umich.edu.  thanks .</td>', 'wow.  this is a great shot.  did you do a double exposure?  please email me with technic...cmcvety@umich.edu.  thanks .', '2002-08-23 02:09:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(78889, 2805, 772, '<td valign="top">Interesting :)  = 5 - jmsetzler</td>', 'Interesting :)  = 5 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-01 08:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78890, 2805, 1877, '<td valign="top">The sun glare off the car is a bit distracting.</td>', 'The sun glare off the car is a bit distracting.', '2002-07-01 14:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78891, 2805, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice work, good idea. Well done. Kee</td>', 'Nice work, good idea. Well done. Kee', '2002-07-01 15:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78892, 2805, 705, '<td valign="top">interesting concept.</td>', 'interesting concept.', '2002-07-01 21:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78893, 2805, 2199, '<td valign="top">Nice composition! Almost looks like a computer rendered image....very good!</td>', 'Nice composition! Almost looks like a computer rendered image....very good!', '2002-07-01 23:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78894, 2805, 1005, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but I disagree with this interpretation.  (Unless you really meant the window as the transparent object, but the blinds are opaque.)  Sun glare on the white car is highly distractive.  Photo 3 Transparency 4 total 4 swash</td>', 'Sorry, but I disagree with this interpretation.  (Unless you really meant the window as the transparent object, but the blinds are opaque.)  Sun glare on the white car is highly distractive.  Photo 3 Transparency 4 total 4 swash', '2002-07-02 19:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78895, 2805, 885, '<td valign="top">I think this whole thing could have been darkened up a bit.  Or a lot.</td>', 'I think this whole thing could have been darkened up a bit.  Or a lot.', '2002-07-03 15:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78896, 2805, 2553, '<td valign="top">Interesting, but the blinds are distracting.</td>', 'Interesting, but the blinds are distracting.', '2002-07-05 10:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78897, 2805, 509, '<td valign="top">The glare of the car outside is a bit distracting.  Also, I would have tried to increase the color saturation a bit.  As it is, the image is dull colorwise.  I don''t feel that the subject is that strong either, but more color may have helped it some.</td>', 'The glare of the car outside is a bit distracting.  Also, I would have tried to increase the color saturation a bit.  As it is, the image is dull colorwise.  I don''t feel that the subject is that strong either, but more color may have helped it some.', '2002-07-05 16:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78898, 2805, 1054, '<td valign="top">Neat idea, certainly a different interpretation of the theme.  I would have liked to have seen this shot earlier or later so the glare off the car wasn''t as harsh.</td>', 'Neat idea, certainly a different interpretation of the theme.  I would have liked to have seen this shot earlier or later so the glare off the car wasn''t as harsh.', '2002-07-07 13:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78899, 2805, 2, '<td valign="top">The very middle-grey color of the blinds in this shot I think brings the overall effectiveness down -- pulling the vivid color of the background closer to very bland tones.  This is surely largely because of the material of the shades, but I think maybe playing with different lighting coming from either in front of or behind the shades might have given you a better color... either lighter and more transparent or a little darker, emphasizing the contrast.</td>', 'The very middle-grey color of the blinds in this shot I think brings the overall effectiveness down -- pulling the vivid color of the background closer to very bland tones.  This is surely largely because of the material of the shades, but I think maybe playing with different lighting coming from either in front of or behind the shades might have given you a better color... either lighter and more transparent or a little darker, emphasizing the contrast.', '2002-07-08 15:35:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(78900, 2807, 142, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what this is, but it looks cool.  Great job!</td>', 'I don''t know what this is, but it looks cool.  Great job!', '2002-07-01 09:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78901, 2807, 1, '<td valign="top">What am I looking at?  I can''t imagine that these are gummy worms...they look more so like baloons filled with water.  I think the lighting could''ve been better to produce more dramatic colors -- the pastels don''t jump out at you.</td>', 'What am I looking at?  I can''t imagine that these are gummy worms...they look more so like baloons filled with water.  I think the lighting could''ve been better to produce more dramatic colors -- the pastels don''t jump out at you.', '2002-07-01 09:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78902, 2807, 2000, '<td valign="top">The arrangement of these gummi worms looks to me like impressionistic intestines.  Nice use of light.  I might have cropped the top either up or down, as the one worm cut off in the middle is a bit of a distraction - cropping down a bit would probably make a 640x427 pic, but the shape doesn''t have much effect on this photograph.</td>', 'The arrangement of these gummi worms looks to me like impressionistic intestines.  Nice use of light.  I might have cropped the top either up or down, as the one worm cut off in the middle is a bit of a distraction - cropping down a bit would probably make a 640x427 pic, but the shape doesn''t have much effect on this photograph.', '2002-07-01 13:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78903, 2807, 1779, '<td valign="top">nice... : )</td>', 'nice... : )', '2002-07-01 14:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78904, 2807, 2172, '<td valign="top">I like this, pretty cool.  good colors-- Just one thing-to me this is more ''translucent'' than transparent-or semi-transparent - but there is a lot of debate going on in the forums- and it doesn''t alter my vote either way.  Great job and cool idea!<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'I like this, pretty cool.  good colors-- Just one thing-to me this is more ''translucent'' than transparent-or semi-transparent - but there is a lot of debate going on in the forums- and it doesn''t alter my vote either way.  Great job and cool idea!Ruthann', '2002-07-01 14:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78905, 2807, 2261, '<td valign="top">great, striking colours</td>', 'great, striking colours', '2002-07-01 15:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78906, 2807, 1078, '<td valign="top">I think this one is being "hurt" by having a white background behind it.  The colors look a little bit more flat than they really are.  (Took it into PS to see if upping the saturation would help.  As soon as I did, and saw it on a grey background, I realized it was fine.)  Very fun abstract.</td>', 'I think this one is being "hurt" by having a white background behind it.  The colors look a little bit more flat than they really are.  (Took it into PS to see if upping the saturation would help.  As soon as I did, and saw it on a grey background, I realized it was fine.)  Very fun abstract.', '2002-07-01 17:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78907, 2807, 705, '<td valign="top">pleasing to the eye, great lines in the setup, wonderful colors, especially interesting is the new shades created by the overlaps.</td>', 'pleasing to the eye, great lines in the setup, wonderful colors, especially interesting is the new shades created by the overlaps.', '2002-07-01 18:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78908, 2807, 2350, '<td valign="top"><br/>    Coloring is great.</td>', '    Coloring is great.', '2002-07-01 19:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
