(78914, 2807, 1856, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites...love the colors, the sliminess, the light.  Great job!   Would be a ten if the cropping didn''t bug me a little. 9</td>', 'One of my favorites...love the colors, the sliminess, the light.  Great job!   Would be a ten if the cropping didn''t bug me a little. 9', '2002-07-02 13:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
