(78938, 2808, 368, '<td valign="top">Hey everyone ... the title "Run with the Little Guy" is Jones Soda''s slogan ... so that explains the title :) - thank you for all those who commented and liked the image .....<br/><br/>I would however would like to know why this image of mine was given "ones"  .. please i''m really curious .... either post here in comments ... or email me photosbyayme@yahoo.com</td>', 'Hey everyone ... the title "Run with the Little Guy" is Jones Soda''s slogan ... so that explains the title :) - thank you for all those who commented and liked the image .....I would however would like to know why this image of mine was given "ones"  .. please i''m really curious .... either post here in comments ... or email me photosbyayme@yahoo.com', '2002-07-08 02:09:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(78939, 2808, 2172, '<td valign="top">Apologies for not commenting earlier.<br/>I really like this photo - just maybe could be a bit brighter for me - but all the same really cool photo, I did notice the reversed reflections in the main bottle.<br/>Great job!</td>', 'Apologies for not commenting earlier.I really like this photo - just maybe could be a bit brighter for me - but all the same really cool photo, I did notice the reversed reflections in the main bottle.Great job!', '2002-07-08 16:59:00.000000', NULL, 0),
