(78984, 2811, 1944, '<td valign="top">Thanks to you all for your comments. By the way, they aren''t reeds in the water, but trees that have fallen in. The water is so clear you can see down about 30 feet. After we got there, we had to wait for about three hours until the sun got to the right angle to show the trees for the transparency part of the picture while not obsuring the reflection of the peaks.</td>', 'Thanks to you all for your comments. By the way, they aren''t reeds in the water, but trees that have fallen in. The water is so clear you can see down about 30 feet. After we got there, we had to wait for about three hours until the sun got to the right angle to show the trees for the transparency part of the picture while not obsuring the reflection of the peaks.', '2002-07-08 01:49:00.000000', NULL, 0),
