(79060, 2815, 2221, '<td valign="top">nice shot. i like how the sun refelcts in the water.<br/>the water is also very transparent, i can see the feet of this buddy ;-)<br/>i would have tried to crop out the dark area on the top. it''s a bit distracting.</td>', 'nice shot. i like how the sun refelcts in the water.the water is also very transparent, i can see the feet of this buddy ;-)i would have tried to crop out the dark area on the top. it''s a bit distracting.', '2002-07-06 23:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(79061, 2815, 1054, '<td valign="top">Cute shot but the composition is poor.  The wall and kickboard in the background are distracting.  A landscape-oriented shot focusing more on the light around the child and the steps would have been much better.</td>', 'Cute shot but the composition is poor.  The wall and kickboard in the background are distracting.  A landscape-oriented shot focusing more on the light around the child and the steps would have been much better.', '2002-07-07 13:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
