(79084, 2817, 772, '<td valign="top">I think this image is really nice... the grain is a little bad though.. maybe from a lower end camera... good shot :) = 7 - jmsetzler</td>', 'I think this image is really nice... the grain is a little bad though.. maybe from a lower end camera... good shot :) = 7 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-04 00:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(79085, 2818, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful sunset... if this was a sunset challenge, I would be voting high.  Without your title, this photo doesn''t say ''transparency'' to me at all.  = 3 - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is a beautiful sunset... if this was a sunset challenge, I would be voting high.  Without your title, this photo doesn''t say ''transparency'' to me at all.  = 3 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-01 01:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
