(79087, 2818, 983, '<td valign="top">Very sharp shot...but... transparency is the topic and this photo doesn''t  even begin to be on topic. Although I do think you did an excellent job with the contrast and and depth of field as well as the overall composition of the shot. In another topic or just in general i would give it a 6.75 to a 7 but in all fairness to those who put the effort into the challenge I had to score it a 2. Good job though.</td>', 'Very sharp shot...but... transparency is the topic and this photo doesn''t  even begin to be on topic. Although I do think you did an excellent job with the contrast and and depth of field as well as the overall composition of the shot. In another topic or just in general i would give it a 6.75 to a 7 but in all fairness to those who put the effort into the challenge I had to score it a 2. Good job though.', '2002-07-01 11:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(79088, 2818, 1175, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture of a sunset.  Very bad picture for this challenge.  I could have taken a picture of anything and said "transparent air".  You are gonna have to try harder than this for me to give you a better grade.</td>', 'Beautiful capture of a sunset.  Very bad picture for this challenge.  I could have taken a picture of anything and said "transparent air".  You are gonna have to try harder than this for me to give you a better grade.', '2002-07-01 12:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
