(79111, 2818, 1054, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but a stretch to fit the theme.  Technically, any photograph is taken through the transparent atmosphere.  It''s not totally off topic since it is refraction off the dust in the atmosphere that creates the strong colors of a sunset, but I don''t think it fully meets the spirit of the challenge either.</td>', 'Nice shot, but a stretch to fit the theme.  Technically, any photograph is taken through the transparent atmosphere.  It''s not totally off topic since it is refraction off the dust in the atmosphere that creates the strong colors of a sunset, but I don''t think it fully meets the spirit of the challenge either.', '2002-07-07 15:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
