(79124, 2819, 885, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, but I think it''s a little bit busy with the reflections and the transparency all together.</td>', 'Interesting idea, but I think it''s a little bit busy with the reflections and the transparency all together.', '2002-07-02 12:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
