(79359, 2837, 509, '<td valign="top">I would have liked more lighting on the pencil.  Otherwise nicely set up.</td>', 'I would have liked more lighting on the pencil.  Otherwise nicely set up.', '2002-07-02 01:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
