(79363, 2837, 1313, '<td valign="top">It fits the category but a pencil in water, what is the point?</td>', 'It fits the category but a pencil in water, what is the point?', '2002-07-02 21:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(79364, 2837, 2004, '<td valign="top">Simple, elegant, and well done</td>', 'Simple, elegant, and well done', '2002-07-03 08:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(79365, 2837, 1054, '<td valign="top">Simple, attractive, and just a little bit surreal.</td>', 'Simple, attractive, and just a little bit surreal.', '2002-07-03 11:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(79366, 2837, 1005, '<td valign="top">It''s broken!  (oh, yea a visual distortion)  Very nice, simple shot.  Well executed.  Debated with myself about the light streaks on the glass, but neither side won.  Photo 9 Transparency 9 total 9 swash</td>', 'It''s broken!  (oh, yea a visual distortion)  Very nice, simple shot.  Well executed.  Debated with myself about the light streaks on the glass, but neither side won.  Photo 9 Transparency 9 total 9 swash', '2002-07-03 14:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(79367, 2837, 2243, '<td valign="top">Uninteresting to me...</td>', 'Uninteresting to me...', '2002-07-03 18:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(79368, 2837, 1944, '<td valign="top">Sometimes the simplist ideas done well are the most effective. I really like the way you handled this photo in your use of coloration and exposure. Very good job.</td>', 'Sometimes the simplist ideas done well are the most effective. I really like the way you handled this photo in your use of coloration and exposure. Very good job.', '2002-07-03 20:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(79369, 2837, 1707, '<td valign="top">definately meets the challenge and all is in focus, but I''d try to extend some extra meaning to it</td>', 'definately meets the challenge and all is in focus, but I''d try to extend some extra meaning to it', '2002-07-04 03:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(79370, 2837, 705, '<td valign="top">good illustration of the warping effect of fluid.  otherwise, pretty bland.  technically good, but not much depth to it.</td>', 'good illustration of the warping effect of fluid.  otherwise, pretty bland.  technically good, but not much depth to it.', '2002-07-04 04:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(79371, 2837, 772, '<td valign="top">The execution and composition of this photo is very nice.  I''m having a hard time getting excited about the overall subject though.  = 8 - jmsetzler</td>', 'The execution and composition of this photo is very nice.  I''m having a hard time getting excited about the overall subject though.  = 8 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-04 13:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(79372, 2837, 2172, '<td valign="top">Nice work.  Although to me, it doesn''t really say ''wow'' - perhaps cropping in at the point the pencil hits the water, showing the distortion of the pencil would be more effective.  Just my opinion.  Still very clear and sharp photography.  Good work.<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Nice work.  Although to me, it doesn''t really say ''wow'' - perhaps cropping in at the point the pencil hits the water, showing the distortion of the pencil would be more effective.  Just my opinion.  Still very clear and sharp photography.  Good work.Ruthann', '2002-07-05 13:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(79373, 2839, 772, '<td valign="top">well, i see the saran wrap but I think this is a weak interpretation of this challenge... better luck next time :) = 2 - jmsetzler</td>', 'well, i see the saran wrap but I think this is a weak interpretation of this challenge... better luck next time :) = 2 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-01 01:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(79374, 2839, 156, '<td valign="top">the middle one without a doubt :o)</td>', 'the middle one without a doubt :o)', '2002-07-01 10:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(79375, 2839, 2323, '<td valign="top">I''m not quite sure what the subject or the intention was.</td>', 'I''m not quite sure what the subject or the intention was.', '2002-07-01 11:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(79376, 2839, 1005, '<td valign="top">Light on the transparency, far bible is too far out of the pic (don''t like mormons?)  Background plain.  (going for the religeous vote?)<br/>Photo 8 Transparency 5 total 5 Swash</td>', 'Light on the transparency, far bible is too far out of the pic (don''t like mormons?)  Background plain.  (going for the religeous vote?)Photo 8 Transparency 5 total 5 Swash', '2002-07-01 15:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(79377, 2839, 705, '<td valign="top">the arrangement of the bibles leads me to the right, and drops me off the edge of the image.  I think all the books should be in focus.  the big bible is too bright, the others too dark.  the saran wrap over them is contrived.</td>', 'the arrangement of the bibles leads me to the right, and drops me off the edge of the image.  I think all the books should be in focus.  the big bible is too bright, the others too dark.  the saran wrap over them is contrived.', '2002-07-01 16:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(79378, 2839, 133, '<td valign="top">not sure what the purpose of the saran wrap is other than to qualify for this competition</td>', 'not sure what the purpose of the saran wrap is other than to qualify for this competition', '2002-07-01 19:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(79379, 2839, 2140, '<td valign="top">is that question for me? my answer is none. i don''t need one!<br/>the picture is boring and bad quality. Is there some reason for putting those books under plastic?? i don''t see it. sorry</td>', 'is that question for me? my answer is none. i don''t need one!the picture is boring and bad quality. Is there some reason for putting those books under plastic?? i don''t see it. sorry', '2002-07-01 21:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(79380, 2839, 1667, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it.</td>', 'I don''t get it.', '2002-07-01 21:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(79381, 2839, 2172, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  What''s the message - does the size of the book indicate a preference?  Only thing is the exposure on the left and the lack of exposure on the right - maybe it''s intentional, even so the right could be just a little moe in order to identify the book.  Perhaps bringing the light up a little.  I''m seeing the emphasis on the larger book.  Creative and good work.<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Interesting.  What''s the message - does the size of the book indicate a preference?  Only thing is the exposure on the left and the lack of exposure on the right - maybe it''s intentional, even so the right could be just a little moe in order to identify the book.  Perhaps bringing the light up a little.  I''m seeing the emphasis on the larger book.  Creative and good work.Ruthann', '2002-07-01 22:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(79382, 2839, 1907, '<td valign="top">The plastic thingummy ...</td>', 'The plastic thingummy ...', '2002-07-02 03:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(79383, 2839, 1041, '<td valign="top">i guess i don''t quite get the connection between different versions of the bible and cling film ... why did you combine the two?  from a technical aspect, the photo is fine, although the lighting could be a little more even, it''s too light on the left and too dark on the right. -- gr8photos (4)</td>', 'i guess i don''t quite get the connection between different versions of the bible and cling film ... why did you combine the two?  from a technical aspect, the photo is fine, although the lighting could be a little more even, it''s too light on the left and too dark on the right. -- gr8photos (4)', '2002-07-02 10:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(79384, 2839, 2337, '<td valign="top">This shot looks a bit forced.  Kind of like you had a message and stuffed it under cling wrap so it would fit the challenge.  A "Through the Len" ministry can be a wonderous calling, but look at ''Reading By Candlelight'' to see the respect your message deserves. Sorry if that sounds harsh, I mean it constructively.</td>', 'This shot looks a bit forced.  Kind of like you had a message and stuffed it under cling wrap so it would fit the challenge.  A "Through the Len" ministry can be a wonderous calling, but look at ''Reading By Candlelight'' to see the respect your message deserves. Sorry if that sounds harsh, I mean it constructively.', '2002-07-03 18:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(79385, 2839, 2478, '<td valign="top">afraid I don''t get it. I get the transparency, but not the point of the composition. also, lighting way too strong on the left, way to weak on the right - unless that was part of the point?</td>', 'afraid I don''t get it. I get the transparency, but not the point of the composition. also, lighting way too strong on the left, way to weak on the right - unless that was part of the point?', '2002-07-04 00:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(79386, 2839, 1031, '<td valign="top">None of these seem to be written by Douglas Adams...</td>', 'None of these seem to be written by Douglas Adams...', '2002-07-06 02:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(79387, 2839, 811, '<td valign="top">Personally, I would probably choose the one on the far left, since you asked. :-)  The lighting (or lack thereof) on the Book of Mormon, makes it difficult to distinguish the lettering.  Maybe if you had used two sources of light, one on either end, all the books would be equally visible, and the brightness on the left would not be as noticeable.  karmat</td>', 'Personally, I would probably choose the one on the far left, since you asked. :-)  The lighting (or lack thereof) on the Book of Mormon, makes it difficult to distinguish the lettering.  Maybe if you had used two sources of light, one on either end, all the books would be equally visible, and the brightness on the left would not be as noticeable.  karmat', '2002-07-06 11:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(79388, 2839, 1054, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I understand what you were trying to convey with this shot.  If your point was to convey a diversity of religion I find it curious that you did not include any non-Christian religions.  I also miss the connection to the theme other than the fact that the bibles were placed under cellophane.  The point of this challenge was to experiment with the effect of transparent/semitransparent objects on light, and this is not done here.</td>', 'I''m not sure I understand what you were trying to convey with this shot.  If your point was to convey a diversity of religion I find it curious that you did not include any non-Christian religions.  I also miss the connection to the theme other than the fact that the bibles were placed under cellophane.  The point of this challenge was to experiment with the effect of transparent/semitransparent objects on light, and this is not done here.', '2002-07-07 10:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(79389, 2840, 1, '<td valign="top">Nice idea done well.</td>', 'Nice idea done well.', '2002-07-01 09:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(79390, 2840, 1759, '<td valign="top">Nice clear shot, good job. I looks like the lighting was basically straight on. I wonder if rim lighting would yeild fewer of the harsh reflections (just pondering).</td>', 'Nice clear shot, good job. I looks like the lighting was basically straight on. I wonder if rim lighting would yeild fewer of the harsh reflections (just pondering).', '2002-07-01 14:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(79391, 2840, 1005, '<td valign="top">Fun, nice colors, but maybe overboard on the bubbles.  Photo 7 Transparency 7 total 7 Swash</td>', 'Fun, nice colors, but maybe overboard on the bubbles.  Photo 7 Transparency 7 total 7 Swash', '2002-07-01 15:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
