(79407, 2843, 2382, '<td valign="top">I like the textures that are almost as if painted on a canvas.  nice colors and composition.  I''d love to hear how you shot this.</td>', 'I like the textures that are almost as if painted on a canvas.  nice colors and composition.  I''d love to hear how you shot this.', '2002-07-02 15:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
