(79530, 2852, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cool layering.  The droplets in the water is the best!  Good choice of text for background, very fitting.  (You might have saved this for next week, kinda works)<br/>Photo 9 Transparency 9 total 9 swash</td>', 'Cool layering.  The droplets in the water is the best!  Good choice of text for background, very fitting.  (You might have saved this for next week, kinda works)Photo 9 Transparency 9 total 9 swash', '2002-07-02 20:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(79531, 2852, 2478, '<td valign="top">i like how the image is cropped at top to focus on the important line of text, and how the repetition of the key word is highlighted below, all tied together nicely by the red. The top line of text is underlined by the positioning of the waterline, and the underline leads down to the REDRUM text.<br/>The natural defractions and distortions are cool, too. I see a lot of thought put into this composition, even before the red stuff was dropped in.</td>', 'i like how the image is cropped at top to focus on the important line of text, and how the repetition of the key word is highlighted below, all tied together nicely by the red. The top line of text is underlined by the positioning of the waterline, and the underline leads down to the REDRUM text.The natural defractions and distortions are cool, too. I see a lot of thought put into this composition, even before the red stuff was dropped in.', '2002-07-04 01:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(79532, 2852, 2183, '<td valign="top">Clever shot.</td>', 'Clever shot.', '2002-07-05 16:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(79533, 2852, 1793, '<td valign="top">stephen king! of course a 10! :)</td>', 'stephen king! of course a 10! :)', '2002-07-05 17:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(79534, 2852, 2221, '<td valign="top">nice idea! i like the "plasma". it really adds something interesting to this often tried setup. i would have cropped the photo on the top, just below the water level.</td>', 'nice idea! i like the "plasma". it really adds something interesting to this often tried setup. i would have cropped the photo on the top, just below the water level.', '2002-07-06 23:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
