(79536, 2853, 1143, '<td valign="top">Hey, that title looks familiar! Great minds think alike, huh? Like mine, I''m not sure everyone will understand how this is transparent. I like the distortion though. Very cool.</td>', 'Hey, that title looks familiar! Great minds think alike, huh? Like mine, I''m not sure everyone will understand how this is transparent. I like the distortion though. Very cool.', '2002-07-01 02:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
