(79715, 2866, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cute  -  either expand your DOF so MICHIE is more in focus, or flatten the CD spacer to the camera more.  Background is OK out of focus, but the subject really needs to be fully there.  Photo 7 Transparency 6 total 7 swash</td>', 'Cute  -  either expand your DOF so MICHIE is more in focus, or flatten the CD spacer to the camera more.  Background is OK out of focus, but the subject really needs to be fully there.  Photo 7 Transparency 6 total 7 swash', '2002-07-02 20:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
