(79720, 2866, 774, '<td valign="top">Hi, Samson. <br/>I would like to apologize for "my" rubbish comment. Actually it is not mine. It was the result of my 3-year old son''s creative hands. I was in the middle of voting, left the computer for a few seconds, and voila... <br/><br/>I am sorry. <br/><br/>Sincerely, <br/><br/>CEO</td>', 'Hi, Samson. I would like to apologize for "my" rubbish comment. Actually it is not mine. It was the result of my 3-year old son''s creative hands. I was in the middle of voting, left the computer for a few seconds, and voila... I am sorry. Sincerely, CEO', '2002-07-09 02:40:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(79721, 2867, 436, '<td valign="top">what an interesting effect</td>', 'what an interesting effect', '2002-07-01 10:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
