(79731, 2869, 1143, '<td valign="top">What is that? I think it''d work better on a solid table than the wood. Nice lighting though.</td>', 'What is that? I think it''d work better on a solid table than the wood. Nice lighting though.', '2002-07-01 02:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
