(79733, 2869, 436, '<td valign="top">the woodgrain is a nice compliment to the rich blue. The reflection is great!  Well done!</td>', 'the woodgrain is a nice compliment to the rich blue. The reflection is great!  Well done!', '2002-07-01 11:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(79734, 2869, 1779, '<td valign="top">nice... : )</td>', 'nice... : )', '2002-07-01 12:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(79735, 2869, 641, '<td valign="top">Cool effect. Only recomendation is maybe a different table. Something other than the wood.</td>', 'Cool effect. Only recomendation is maybe a different table. Something other than the wood.', '2002-07-01 16:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(79736, 2869, 1005, '<td valign="top">Yes, it is blue.  Vaguely off center for challenge, but acceptable (others might be less chariable, but I''m in a good mood.)  Photo 8 Transparency 7 total 7</td>', 'Yes, it is blue.  Vaguely off center for challenge, but acceptable (others might be less chariable, but I''m in a good mood.)  Photo 8 Transparency 7 total 7', '2002-07-01 20:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(79737, 2869, 509, '<td valign="top">I think the wood grain takes away from the shot....maybe something like a grey table.  The glass has a very cold feeling, which I think could be emphasized by the table being cool as well.  I think the wood may be too "warm" for this to work just right, but it is very nice all the same.   Score - 8</td>', 'I think the wood grain takes away from the shot....maybe something like a grey table.  The glass has a very cold feeling, which I think could be emphasized by the table being cool as well.  I think the wood may be too "warm" for this to work just right, but it is very nice all the same.   Score - 8', '2002-07-02 01:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(79738, 2869, 2488, '<td valign="top">cool use of light</td>', 'cool use of light', '2002-07-02 10:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(79739, 2869, 2186, '<td valign="top">Beautifully lit, beautiful composition, fantastic detail, should be a poster. Nice "fine art" style.  OK, How''d ya di it???</td>', 'Beautifully lit, beautiful composition, fantastic detail, should be a poster. Nice "fine art" style.  OK, How''d ya di it???', '2002-07-02 10:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(79740, 2869, 1856, '<td valign="top">Beautiful blue.  I would have preferred this on a solid (no pattern) surface.  The wood grain doesn''t really fit here.</td>', 'Beautiful blue.  I would have preferred this on a solid (no pattern) surface.  The wood grain doesn''t really fit here.', '2002-07-02 11:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(79741, 2869, 2261, '<td valign="top">look good in a blue room</td>', 'look good in a blue room', '2002-07-02 15:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(79742, 2869, 1313, '<td valign="top">A little dark not very interesting subject.</td>', 'A little dark not very interesting subject.', '2002-07-02 21:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(79743, 2869, 1759, '<td valign="top">Great color and nice capture of the ice form. The wood surface detracts from the shot. This would really look much better if shot on a solid black or white surface.</td>', 'Great color and nice capture of the ice form. The wood surface detracts from the shot. This would really look much better if shot on a solid black or white surface.', '2002-07-02 21:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
