(79866, 2876, 2247, '<td valign="top">Bone and flesh on x-ray. . . .interesting concept.  The bone part looks good, but the flesh part (leg?) needs a little more contrast, which would create more depth.</td>', 'Bone and flesh on x-ray. . . .interesting concept.  The bone part looks good, but the flesh part (leg?) needs a little more contrast, which would create more depth.', '2002-07-07 00:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(79867, 2876, 1128, '<td valign="top">This is a good idea.  You''ve got it lined up well, and I like the lighting, so you can see through the xray, but I wish the picture was just a little more in focus and not so grainy.</td>', 'This is a good idea.  You''ve got it lined up well, and I like the lighting, so you can see through the xray, but I wish the picture was just a little more in focus and not so grainy.', '2002-07-07 10:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(79868, 2876, 1054, '<td valign="top">Great idea and you pulled it off well.</td>', 'Great idea and you pulled it off well.', '2002-07-07 15:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(79869, 2876, 472, '<td valign="top">GREAT concept.  i agree with yellowpeep''s comment on the focus though.  perfect focus would have definitely pulled this one up into the top 10! :)</td>', 'GREAT concept.  i agree with yellowpeep''s comment on the focus though.  perfect focus would have definitely pulled this one up into the top 10! :)', '2002-07-08 10:15:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(79870, 2878, 1877, '<td valign="top">I really dont know what to say about this one.. um, a different concept.. thats for sure!</td>', 'I really dont know what to say about this one.. um, a different concept.. thats for sure!', '2002-07-01 02:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(79871, 2878, 1569, '<td valign="top">What can I say---glass table with crack.You are going to be all over the forums.<br/>To crack or not to crack...</td>', 'What can I say---glass table with crack.You are going to be all over the forums.To crack or not to crack...', '2002-07-01 15:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(79872, 2878, 2261, '<td valign="top">love it!</td>', 'love it!', '2002-07-01 15:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(79873, 2878, 1041, '<td valign="top">your photo is very pixelated.  i''m not sure whether that was an intent and you saved your file that small for that purpose, or not.  if not, there are some tutorials on this site that help you save the files so that your photos aren''t so pixelated.  it may also have something to do with the amount of photoshopping to distort the colors, i''m not sure.  photo meets the challenge but doesn''t do much for me, sorry.  guess us germans just don''t have a sense of humor ;) (gr8photos - 3)</td>', 'your photo is very pixelated.  i''m not sure whether that was an intent and you saved your file that small for that purpose, or not.  if not, there are some tutorials on this site that help you save the files so that your photos aren''t so pixelated.  it may also have something to do with the amount of photoshopping to distort the colors, i''m not sure.  photo meets the challenge but doesn''t do much for me, sorry.  guess us germans just don''t have a sense of humor ;) (gr8photos - 3)', '2002-07-01 16:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(79874, 2878, 2111, '<td valign="top">dude ure disturbed</td>', 'dude ure disturbed', '2002-07-01 17:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(79875, 2878, 327, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot.  Kee</td>', 'Very cool shot.  Kee', '2002-07-01 17:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(79876, 2878, 1204, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  How did this look with "more normal" colors?</td>', 'Nice idea.  How did this look with "more normal" colors?', '2002-07-01 19:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(79877, 2878, 1005, '<td valign="top">Inverse coloring is interesting.  Almost daring model, maybe too riske'', but this is art after all.  Wierd, but I am esp. drawn to the points where the glass comes in contact with the model.  I might have preferred the whole table.....<br/>Photo 8 Transparency 7 total 8 swash</td>', 'Inverse coloring is interesting.  Almost daring model, maybe too riske'', but this is art after all.  Wierd, but I am esp. drawn to the points where the glass comes in contact with the model.  I might have preferred the whole table.....Photo 8 Transparency 7 total 8 swash', '2002-07-01 19:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(79878, 2878, 2217, '<td valign="top">Fantastic.  Arty and interesting.</td>', 'Fantastic.  Arty and interesting.', '2002-07-02 01:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(79879, 2878, 2000, '<td valign="top">The fish at the top is upside down, and so looks dead.  Interesting photo concept.</td>', 'The fish at the top is upside down, and so looks dead.  Interesting photo concept.', '2002-07-02 11:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(79880, 2878, 1856, '<td valign="top">Hilarious!  This looks like something I would try and get my husband to do.  Is that bottle of booze empty?  Your table looks a little...ummm...endangered on one end.</td>', 'Hilarious!  This looks like something I would try and get my husband to do.  Is that bottle of booze empty?  Your table looks a little...ummm...endangered on one end.', '2002-07-02 13:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(79881, 2878, 2079, '<td valign="top">This is odd - but I can go with it - I like the color adjustments, interesting because the bottom fish almost appears untouched. neat effect. If Atlas is buisy holding up the world.... Who is holding up this table?? Very creative - Other family members must think you''ve cracked.  -Good luck with this one-     6</td>', 'This is odd - but I can go with it - I like the color adjustments, interesting because the bottom fish almost appears untouched. neat effect. If Atlas is buisy holding up the world.... Who is holding up this table?? Very creative - Other family members must think you''ve cracked.  -Good luck with this one-     6', '2002-07-03 03:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(79882, 2878, 1882, '<td valign="top">yuck.  just what i want to see under my bottle of corona; a fat ass.  And what''s with the chrome/negative effect?  I would have given you a higher score if you just painted your body silver or gold and THEN took the shot in color.  (but then again, maybe not).</td>', 'yuck.  just what i want to see under my bottle of corona; a fat ass.  And what''s with the chrome/negative effect?  I would have given you a higher score if you just painted your body silver or gold and THEN took the shot in color.  (but then again, maybe not).', '2002-07-03 11:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(79883, 2878, 705, '<td valign="top">The colorization is irritating.  Nice set up.  Lots of noise in the image.  Excellent props.  Plastic water bottle doesn''t fit, aesthetically, and throws off the balance.</td>', 'The colorization is irritating.  Nice set up.  Lots of noise in the image.  Excellent props.  Plastic water bottle doesn''t fit, aesthetically, and throws off the balance.', '2002-07-03 18:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(79884, 2878, 772, '<td valign="top">this is cool.. lol... = 7 - jmsetzler</td>', 'this is cool.. lol... = 7 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-04 00:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(79885, 2878, 2540, '<td valign="top">Great, imaginative photo!</td>', 'Great, imaginative photo!', '2002-07-04 05:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(79886, 2878, 1031, '<td valign="top">Effective use of color inversion</td>', 'Effective use of color inversion', '2002-07-06 02:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(79887, 2878, 811, '<td valign="top">At first I wondered why you would do a negative image.  Then, I converted it and saw why.  Good choice.  Black and white also was somewhat interesting.  I think a different angle would serve this picture better.  Maybe lower (but not too much!) and more parallel to the table.  Or you could have cropped it equally on all four sides, so that equal amounts  of the table were cut or kept.  karmat</td>', 'At first I wondered why you would do a negative image.  Then, I converted it and saw why.  Good choice.  Black and white also was somewhat interesting.  I think a different angle would serve this picture better.  Maybe lower (but not too much!) and more parallel to the table.  Or you could have cropped it equally on all four sides, so that equal amounts  of the table were cut or kept.  karmat', '2002-07-06 11:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(79888, 2878, 1054, '<td valign="top">Bizarre shot, and I don''t particularly like inverted shots in general, sorry.  I''m not saure what your point was.</td>', 'Bizarre shot, and I don''t particularly like inverted shots in general, sorry.  I''m not saure what your point was.', '2002-07-07 11:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
