(79907, 2879, 705, '<td valign="top">Oooh, this is very striking, considering how detailed the background is.  Great perspective, lovely colors, fabulous warping.  Gush, gush, gush.</td>', 'Oooh, this is very striking, considering how detailed the background is.  Great perspective, lovely colors, fabulous warping.  Gush, gush, gush.', '2002-07-03 18:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
