(80076, 2892, 811, '<td valign="top">I love this shot.  I wanted to do something similar, but you have far surpassed anything I was looking at.  Excellent job.  Great depth.   At he end of the week, I am still looking at it and loving it.  Way to go!  karmat</td>', 'I love this shot.  I wanted to do something similar, but you have far surpassed anything I was looking at.  Excellent job.  Great depth.   At he end of the week, I am still looking at it and loving it.  Way to go!  karmat', '2002-07-01 16:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80077, 2892, 1041, '<td valign="top">john, i knew you had a winner here as soon as i saw this on deviantart (before the challenge).  awesome shot.  i''m usually a little wary of flags (being german and all that), but this one is really well done (you can see what it is, but at the same time it appears very abstract).  i like the vertical angle for the flag, and how the little water droplets make it look as if they are far away, this shot has a lot of perspective to it.  how far away was the flag from the glass?  you are definitely in my top 3 this week.  -- gr8photos (10)</td>', 'john, i knew you had a winner here as soon as i saw this on deviantart (before the challenge).  awesome shot.  i''m usually a little wary of flags (being german and all that), but this one is really well done (you can see what it is, but at the same time it appears very abstract).  i like the vertical angle for the flag, and how the little water droplets make it look as if they are far away, this shot has a lot of perspective to it.  how far away was the flag from the glass?  you are definitely in my top 3 this week.  -- gr8photos (10)', '2002-07-01 16:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80078, 2892, 1856, '<td valign="top">I love this!  Great idea...awesome focus/clarity.  I might try this for my son''s room.  Top 3 for sure! 10</td>', 'I love this!  Great idea...awesome focus/clarity.  I might try this for my son''s room.  Top 3 for sure! 10', '2002-07-01 17:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80079, 2892, 1078, '<td valign="top">I love this, but I think the whites have too much of a blue/cyan tint to them -- as if this was taken on an overcast day.  There''s an easy way to tweak this (legally, I think) in PS -- but I don''t know if you have that program.  If you''re not sure what I mean, let me know and I can tweak a copy for you for comparison.</td>', 'I love this, but I think the whites have too much of a blue/cyan tint to them -- as if this was taken on an overcast day.  There''s an easy way to tweak this (legally, I think) in PS -- but I don''t know if you have that program.  If you''re not sure what I mean, let me know and I can tweak a copy for you for comparison.', '2002-07-01 18:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
