(80140, 2892, 326, '<td valign="top">Great job John! What a wonderful shot! I missed voting this week I would have scored this image high. How could seven people score this a 1....I don''t get it..... A job well done!</td>', 'Great job John! What a wonderful shot! I missed voting this week I would have scored this image high. How could seven people score this a 1....I don''t get it..... A job well done!', '2002-07-08 01:41:00.000000', NULL, 0),
