(80212, 2901, 772, '<td valign="top">I like it!  I love the color and concept on this shot... I think the exposure may be a little hot, but the overall image impresses me quite a bit.  The only minor details that I think could be better in this image are the exposure and the tilt to the right on the glass.  Im guessin that correction on both of those would probably score an extra point or maybe two.  Good shot!  = 8 - jmsetzler</td>', 'I like it!  I love the color and concept on this shot... I think the exposure may be a little hot, but the overall image impresses me quite a bit.  The only minor details that I think could be better in this image are the exposure and the tilt to the right on the glass.  Im guessin that correction on both of those would probably score an extra point or maybe two.  Good shot!  = 8 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-03 12:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
