(80289, 2906, 554, '<td valign="top">Congrats!  This pic was #145 to download and was my first 10 on the first pass through. ABSOLUTELY FANTASTIC !  I love this shot. <br/>Now, I will review my other votes and there will be other 10''s, but this has to be the winner.  You must be very proud!</td>', 'Congrats!  This pic was #145 to download and was my first 10 on the first pass through. ABSOLUTELY FANTASTIC !  I love this shot. Now, I will review my other votes and there will be other 10''s, but this has to be the winner.  You must be very proud!', '2002-07-03 23:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80290, 2906, 1897, '<td valign="top">I really like this image, and want to know how you did the affect.  I can''t figure out how without breaking the rules.</td>', 'I really like this image, and want to know how you did the affect.  I can''t figure out how without breaking the rules.', '2002-07-04 21:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80291, 2906, 715, '<td valign="top">Amazing effect and beautifull photo overall.</td>', 'Amazing effect and beautifull photo overall.', '2002-07-05 09:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80292, 2906, 737, '<td valign="top">First place. A 10.</td>', 'First place. A 10.', '2002-07-05 16:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80293, 2906, 573, '<td valign="top">This is a great picture, how did you take it?  The only thing IMO that could be better are the highlights in the little girls hair are washed-out, one of my top ten picks this week.</td>', 'This is a great picture, how did you take it?  The only thing IMO that could be better are the highlights in the little girls hair are washed-out, one of my top ten picks this week.', '2002-07-05 18:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80294, 2906, 933, '<td valign="top">A haunting, interesting photo.  Is that a ps filter, or is there a peice of glass between the camera &amp; subjects.  The connection to transperancy is quite thin, keeping this from getting my highest marks, but because it is such a strong image, I still must give it a 9.  Very nice work.</td>', 'A haunting, interesting photo.  Is that a ps filter, or is there a peice of glass between the camera & subjects.  The connection to transperancy is quite thin, keeping this from getting my highest marks, but because it is such a strong image, I still must give it a 9.  Very nice work.', '2002-07-05 18:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80295, 2906, 2323, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the explanation as to how you had done it... without it was hard to tell if it was photoshopped, or a photo of a painting of some sort (my thought), or something else.  I guess the fact that is was hard to tell just shows how creative the photo was!</td>', 'Thanks for the explanation as to how you had done it... without it was hard to tell if it was photoshopped, or a photo of a painting of some sort (my thought), or something else.  I guess the fact that is was hard to tell just shows how creative the photo was!', '2002-07-05 23:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80296, 2906, 2079, '<td valign="top">This is great work....Definitely a time consuming shot - 8</td>', 'This is great work....Definitely a time consuming shot - 8', '2002-07-05 23:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80297, 2906, 2468, '<td valign="top">Very well done!</td>', 'Very well done!', '2002-07-06 00:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80298, 2906, 714, '<td valign="top">creative 10 interesting 10 focus 10 framing 10 = 10   This photo is very interesting.  I would like to see the How To for this one.   Good job. It looks like you worked hard on this one.  :)</td>', 'creative 10 interesting 10 focus 10 framing 10 = 10   This photo is very interesting.  I would like to see the How To for this one.   Good job. It looks like you worked hard on this one.  :)', '2002-07-06 01:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80299, 2906, 1880, '<td valign="top">This is a very original photo ... 10 for creativity,  10 for composition, 10 for post editing ( cropping,  brightnes correction, etc)</td>', 'This is a very original photo ... 10 for creativity,  10 for composition, 10 for post editing ( cropping,  brightnes correction, etc)', '2002-07-06 09:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80300, 2906, 811, '<td valign="top">I just read your post on the forums.  For what it is worth, I did not think you cheated, and I thought it looked like a "scratched mirror."  (What does that tell you about some of the mirrors at my house?)  This is totally awesome, and I may try something like it with my son and husband.  Sorry people tried to DQ you.  This shot deserves to be a winner, but unfortunately, many people do not read the forums, and will never know.  karmat</td>', 'I just read your post on the forums.  For what it is worth, I did not think you cheated, and I thought it looked like a "scratched mirror."  (What does that tell you about some of the mirrors at my house?)  This is totally awesome, and I may try something like it with my son and husband.  Sorry people tried to DQ you.  This shot deserves to be a winner, but unfortunately, many people do not read the forums, and will never know.  karmat', '2002-07-06 10:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80301, 2906, 2187, '<td valign="top">AT FIRST I GAVE A 3 ...  NOW I GIVE A 10.... BUT IN ALL FAIRNESS WITHOUT THE EXPLANATION I WOULD NOT HAVE CHANGED THE SCORE...SO I WILL GIVE YOU HALF OF THE REMAINDER ROUNDED UP    (8)    Bo;-{)</td>', 'AT FIRST I GAVE A 3 ...  NOW I GIVE A 10.... BUT IN ALL FAIRNESS WITHOUT THE EXPLANATION I WOULD NOT HAVE CHANGED THE SCORE...SO I WILL GIVE YOU HALF OF THE REMAINDER ROUNDED UP    (8)    Bo;-{)', '2002-07-06 11:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80302, 2906, 1054, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot... whatever it is you shot through gives a very interesting effect to the whole image.</td>', 'Excellent shot... whatever it is you shot through gives a very interesting effect to the whole image.', '2002-07-07 17:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
