(80304, 2906, 806, '<td valign="top">My guess on this during voiting was this was shot thru a piece of frosted/patterned glass.  One of my favorites! Nice work!</td>', 'My guess on this during voiting was this was shot thru a piece of frosted/patterned glass.  One of my favorites! Nice work!', '2002-07-08 09:40:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(80305, 2906, 1143, '<td valign="top">I posted a more detailed explanation of this shot in the forums during voting. I''m glad so many people liked it!</td>', 'I posted a more detailed explanation of this shot in the forums during voting. I''m glad so many people liked it!', '2002-07-08 21:01:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(80306, 2907, 2474, '<td valign="top">cool!  what is this?? :)</td>', 'cool!  what is this?? :)', '2002-07-01 03:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80307, 2907, 1175, '<td valign="top">Excellent.  I really like this one alot.</td>', 'Excellent.  I really like this one alot.', '2002-07-01 12:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80308, 2907, 1779, '<td valign="top">nice... : )</td>', 'nice... : )', '2002-07-01 12:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80309, 2907, 1569, '<td valign="top">Really like this one --great pix!!</td>', 'Really like this one --great pix!!', '2002-07-01 14:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80310, 2907, 1944, '<td valign="top">Nice macro image. I like the way the out of focus background accentuates the ice cube, giving it the emphasis it needs without a color difference. The only thing I would have done is to have a little more DOF so  the near edge of the cube would be more in focus. ''Food''  shots are hard, especially if they''re frozen. You might have tried setting up with one cube, then changing to the ''real'' one for the final shot, unless you wanted the slightly melted look. Nice job. Sheyingshi88.</td>', 'Nice macro image. I like the way the out of focus background accentuates the ice cube, giving it the emphasis it needs without a color difference. The only thing I would have done is to have a little more DOF so  the near edge of the cube would be more in focus. ''Food''  shots are hard, especially if they''re frozen. You might have tried setting up with one cube, then changing to the ''real'' one for the final shot, unless you wanted the slightly melted look. Nice job. Sheyingshi88.', '2002-07-01 14:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80311, 2907, 1759, '<td valign="top">Cool shot! Good job.</td>', 'Cool shot! Good job.', '2002-07-01 14:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80312, 2907, 2261, '<td valign="top">i loved this one</td>', 'i loved this one', '2002-07-01 15:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80313, 2907, 327, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, creative, well done. Kee</td>', 'Very nice shot, creative, well done. Kee', '2002-07-01 19:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80314, 2907, 133, '<td valign="top">a nice close up</td>', 'a nice close up', '2002-07-01 19:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80315, 2907, 509, '<td valign="top">Great depth of field.  Colors certainly set the mood</td>', 'Great depth of field.  Colors certainly set the mood', '2002-07-02 01:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80316, 2907, 2079, '<td valign="top">semi-transparent 10<br/>distortion 5<br/>colors in objects 4<br/>Be creative 8<br/></td>', 'semi-transparent 10distortion 5colors in objects 4Be creative 8', '2002-07-02 03:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80317, 2907, 772, '<td valign="top">Well, I expected to see ice in this challenge.  I won''t say the "C" word because I don''t believe in it :))  First of all, I don''t believe you could have done a better job photographing this ice cube.  I even like the way you have positioned it in the frame. The lighting is also very appealing to me.  The surface reflections on top of the ice are just amazing :)  I originally gave this shot a 7 on the first vote, but as I come back through to comment, I sometimes adjust the score.  I can''t see any reason that this photo should not have a 10 this week :) Good work! - jmsetzler</td>', 'Well, I expected to see ice in this challenge.  I won''t say the "C" word because I don''t believe in it :))  First of all, I don''t believe you could have done a better job photographing this ice cube.  I even like the way you have positioned it in the frame. The lighting is also very appealing to me.  The surface reflections on top of the ice are just amazing :)  I originally gave this shot a 7 on the first vote, but as I come back through to comment, I sometimes adjust the score.  I can''t see any reason that this photo should not have a 10 this week :) Good work! - jmsetzler', '2002-07-02 16:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80318, 2907, 1005, '<td valign="top">Ice is a great subject.  I am assuming you were going for the bubbles inside and not whatever is on the other side of the cube.  Maybe, just maybe,  removing the car from the background, would have been nice, otherwise GREAT!<br/>Photo 8 Transparency 8 total 8 swash</td>', 'Ice is a great subject.  I am assuming you were going for the bubbles inside and not whatever is on the other side of the cube.  Maybe, just maybe,  removing the car from the background, would have been nice, otherwise GREAT!Photo 8 Transparency 8 total 8 swash', '2002-07-02 19:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80319, 2907, 2146, '<td valign="top">ice..i mean nice..cool pic</td>', 'ice..i mean nice..cool pic', '2002-07-02 23:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80320, 2907, 1, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, whatever you put it on has that artic/cold look as well and is a nice touch.</td>', 'Nice shot, whatever you put it on has that artic/cold look as well and is a nice touch.', '2002-07-03 11:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80321, 2907, 806, '<td valign="top">Clear, sharp, and the blue tone gives a chilly feeling.</td>', 'Clear, sharp, and the blue tone gives a chilly feeling.', '2002-07-03 17:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80322, 2907, 2337, '<td valign="top">1 of 4 10''s I gave this week... Great shot!</td>', '1 of 4 10''s I gave this week... Great shot!', '2002-07-03 19:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80323, 2907, 1379, '<td valign="top">It makes me think of a little helmet with a little frozen brain inside.  My husband thinks it looks like Devil''s Tower.  Very evocative!</td>', 'It makes me think of a little helmet with a little frozen brain inside.  My husband thinks it looks like Devil''s Tower.  Very evocative!', '2002-07-04 00:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80324, 2907, 2478, '<td valign="top">nice detail in the cube, works well with the DoF.</td>', 'nice detail in the cube, works well with the DoF.', '2002-07-04 01:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80325, 2907, 715, '<td valign="top">Cool :) Great looking detail in the ice.</td>', 'Cool :) Great looking detail in the ice.', '2002-07-05 09:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80326, 2907, 2172, '<td valign="top">Very well done.  Great work!</td>', 'Very well done.  Great work!', '2002-07-05 13:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80327, 2907, 1054, '<td valign="top">Good subject choice and composition.  If you waited a minute so you had a slightly larger accumulation of water under the ice cube it might have been even better.</td>', 'Good subject choice and composition.  If you waited a minute so you had a slightly larger accumulation of water under the ice cube it might have been even better.', '2002-07-07 11:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80328, 2907, 2221, '<td valign="top">very nice shot. i like the colors, refelections and the abstact pattern inside the ice. good "transparency". maybe a little more DOF would be better, because the lower part of the ice cube is blurred.</td>', 'very nice shot. i like the colors, refelections and the abstact pattern inside the ice. good "transparency". maybe a little more DOF would be better, because the lower part of the ice cube is blurred.', '2002-07-07 22:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80329, 2907, 472, '<td valign="top">good one! : )</td>', 'good one! : )', '2002-07-08 09:36:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(80330, 2908, 1779, '<td valign="top">nice... : )</td>', 'nice... : )', '2002-07-01 13:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80331, 2908, 772, '<td valign="top">interesting... I can''t really tell what I''m looking through here.. Is the lack of focus and sharpness here part of the abstract nature of this shot? = 5 - jmsetzler</td>', 'interesting... I can''t really tell what I''m looking through here.. Is the lack of focus and sharpness here part of the abstract nature of this shot? = 5 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-01 13:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80332, 2908, 1759, '<td valign="top">Good job on finding an unusual subject and view! I score it high on abstract and interesting detail. The exposure is metered well, but the blurring  is somewhat annoying because it isn''t symmetrical from left to right. This creates a tension as I view it, which left me with some mixed feelings.</td>', 'Good job on finding an unusual subject and view! I score it high on abstract and interesting detail. The exposure is metered well, but the blurring  is somewhat annoying because it isn''t symmetrical from left to right. This creates a tension as I view it, which left me with some mixed feelings.', '2002-07-01 14:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80333, 2908, 327, '<td valign="top">Cool abstract shot. Like it. Kee</td>', 'Cool abstract shot. Like it. Kee', '2002-07-01 19:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80334, 2908, 2146, '<td valign="top">neat shot</td>', 'neat shot', '2002-07-02 02:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80335, 2908, 1041, '<td valign="top">while you have definitely fulfilled the challenge, this image is so distorted that i am having a hard time making out what i''m really looking at.  there are lights at the top, and i think there''s a window and red carpet, but it is hard.  also, nothing''s totally sharp (difficult with semi-transparent, i know).  a little more of a focal point would''ve given you a higher score from me.  -- gr8photos (4)</td>', 'while you have definitely fulfilled the challenge, this image is so distorted that i am having a hard time making out what i''m really looking at.  there are lights at the top, and i think there''s a window and red carpet, but it is hard.  also, nothing''s totally sharp (difficult with semi-transparent, i know).  a little more of a focal point would''ve given you a higher score from me.  -- gr8photos (4)', '2002-07-02 12:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80336, 2908, 637, '<td valign="top">I see that there is transparency here, but I need to know what i''m seeing through, and what''s on the other side... just not "clear" enough to me in this image.</td>', 'I see that there is transparency here, but I need to know what i''m seeing through, and what''s on the other side... just not "clear" enough to me in this image.', '2002-07-03 11:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80337, 2908, 1005, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, I probably shouldn''t vote on this one as I just don''t see it.  Edge of what? This is in no way a horrible shot, except that it didn''t reach/communicate to me.  Call me simple, dumb, nieve, whatever.  Photo 6 Transparency ??? Total 5 swash</td>', 'I''m sorry, I probably shouldn''t vote on this one as I just don''t see it.  Edge of what? This is in no way a horrible shot, except that it didn''t reach/communicate to me.  Call me simple, dumb, nieve, whatever.  Photo 6 Transparency ??? Total 5 swash', '2002-07-03 13:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80338, 2908, 1944, '<td valign="top">An interesting picture, but to me it has very little focal point. My eye doesn''t have a place to ''snap'' to, and there is no trail around your picture to hold it.</td>', 'An interesting picture, but to me it has very little focal point. My eye doesn''t have a place to ''snap'' to, and there is no trail around your picture to hold it.', '2002-07-03 14:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80339, 2908, 1313, '<td valign="top">what is this?</td>', 'what is this?', '2002-07-03 21:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
