(80349, 2909, 1907, '<td valign="top">The compression makes it look like the picture was scanned out of a magazine...</td>', 'The compression makes it look like the picture was scanned out of a magazine...', '2002-07-03 07:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80350, 2909, 885, '<td valign="top">Sorta looks like it''s underwater...</td>', 'Sorta looks like it''s underwater...', '2002-07-03 11:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80351, 2909, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very artsy.  The veil makes the rose look almost printed.  Neat trick, great bckrgd.<br/>Photo 9 Transparency 9 total 9 swash</td>', 'Very artsy.  The veil makes the rose look almost printed.  Neat trick, great bckrgd.Photo 9 Transparency 9 total 9 swash', '2002-07-03 14:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80352, 2909, 714, '<td valign="top">creative 7 interesting 3 focus 8 framing 9 = 7</td>', 'creative 7 interesting 3 focus 8 framing 9 = 7', '2002-07-03 14:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80353, 2909, 509, '<td valign="top">At first I didn''t notice any transparency, it looks like the graininess could be moire or something.  Still, I think the effect could be made more powerful. Nice shot.</td>', 'At first I didn''t notice any transparency, it looks like the graininess could be moire or something.  Still, I think the effect could be made more powerful. Nice shot.', '2002-07-05 17:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80354, 2909, 1054, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but an odd angle.  It also seems as if there''s a lot of dead space.  A tighter crop would have improved this.</td>', 'Nice shot but an odd angle.  It also seems as if there''s a lot of dead space.  A tighter crop would have improved this.', '2002-07-07 13:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80355, 2912, 1, '<td valign="top">Nicea idea, but it came out as a big blur.  Clarity is key.</td>', 'Nicea idea, but it came out as a big blur.  Clarity is key.', '2002-07-01 09:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80356, 2912, 2172, '<td valign="top">Cool. creative, abstract.  I like how there''s only one small portion that is relatively clear.  good job.<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Cool. creative, abstract.  I like how there''s only one small portion that is relatively clear.  good job.Ruthann', '2002-07-01 13:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80357, 2912, 2146, '<td valign="top">i am glad we dont see like that</td>', 'i am glad we dont see like that', '2002-07-01 14:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80358, 2912, 1041, '<td valign="top">it is obvious that you took this photo through something (semi)transparent, so you fulfilled the challenge.  however, i am left with the impression that there is too much out of focus in this shot and my eyes are searching for a place in the photo where they can rest.  since i don''t know what it is that you took the photo through (even though i tried to figure it out), i''m not sure what advice to give you.    i don''t know if pulling back from the tranparent object would''ve helped or not.  sorry. (gr8photos - 2)</td>', 'it is obvious that you took this photo through something (semi)transparent, so you fulfilled the challenge.  however, i am left with the impression that there is too much out of focus in this shot and my eyes are searching for a place in the photo where they can rest.  since i don''t know what it is that you took the photo through (even though i tried to figure it out), i''m not sure what advice to give you.    i don''t know if pulling back from the tranparent object would''ve helped or not.  sorry. (gr8photos - 2)', '2002-07-01 15:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80359, 2912, 705, '<td valign="top">a very interesting approach.  it''s disorienting.  nice colors.</td>', 'a very interesting approach.  it''s disorienting.  nice colors.', '2002-07-01 15:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80360, 2912, 1856, '<td valign="top">Way to blurred for me.  I think it would have been nice otherwise.</td>', 'Way to blurred for me.  I think it would have been nice otherwise.', '2002-07-01 17:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
