(80390, 2913, 1202, '<td valign="top">Just in case any body comes back I wanted to let you know I took this shot at a roadside rest in Utah.   My daughter and I were scrounging the whole area looking for something to catch this sunset through.   Our final decision was to use a piece of broken glass with some water droplets on it.   I actually only took three pictures and didn''t have a whole lot to work with.   I over worked it but liked the effect  so decided to use it.   Thanks to all of you that voted and especially to those that took the extra effort to give  the comments.  Dick</td>', 'Just in case any body comes back I wanted to let you know I took this shot at a roadside rest in Utah.   My daughter and I were scrounging the whole area looking for something to catch this sunset through.   Our final decision was to use a piece of broken glass with some water droplets on it.   I actually only took three pictures and didn''t have a whole lot to work with.   I over worked it but liked the effect  so decided to use it.   Thanks to all of you that voted and especially to those that took the extra effort to give  the comments.  Dick', '2002-07-08 10:27:00.000000', NULL, 0),
