(80444, 2917, 637, '<td valign="top">I''ve said it before.  I think the NYC transportation infrastructure is perhaps the greatest untapped subject in photography.  This is very nicely done.  I love it, and I can feel the train and can imagine myself as the photographer.  My questions for the photographer:  Is the moving train coming to a stop, starting its departure, or skipping the station as an express?  Which 86 Street station is this?  (I know of several (in Brooklyn and Manhattan, and I''m pretty sure its not 86th/CPW.) 7 sjgleah</td>', 'I''ve said it before.  I think the NYC transportation infrastructure is perhaps the greatest untapped subject in photography.  This is very nicely done.  I love it, and I can feel the train and can imagine myself as the photographer.  My questions for the photographer:  Is the moving train coming to a stop, starting its departure, or skipping the station as an express?  Which 86 Street station is this?  (I know of several (in Brooklyn and Manhattan, and I''m pretty sure its not 86th/CPW.) 7 sjgleah', '2002-07-03 12:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
