(80504, 2920, 1005, '<td valign="top">You got the face very good, but the edges of the bubble moved.  Maybe a faster exposure would have stopped that motion and better defined the edges of the bubble.  Challenge well met.  Photo 8 Transparency 8 total 8 swash</td>', 'You got the face very good, but the edges of the bubble moved.  Maybe a faster exposure would have stopped that motion and better defined the edges of the bubble.  Challenge well met.  Photo 8 Transparency 8 total 8 swash', '2002-07-02 14:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
