(80540, 2922, 806, '<td valign="top">You are ahead of yourself on FEAR! Just a joke.<br/>This is clever.</td>', 'You are ahead of yourself on FEAR! Just a joke.This is clever.', '2002-07-03 17:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80541, 2922, 772, '<td valign="top">Now here''s an abstract image that I like :)  I think I may be looking through glass.. this almost appears to be a distored reflection more than a transparency but the benefit of the doubt is yours on this one... the only minor complaing i have is the spots in the lower right quadrant of the image... good shot! = 7 - jmsetzler</td>', 'Now here''s an abstract image that I like :)  I think I may be looking through glass.. this almost appears to be a distored reflection more than a transparency but the benefit of the doubt is yours on this one... the only minor complaing i have is the spots in the lower right quadrant of the image... good shot! = 7 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-03 23:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
