(80545, 2922, 1054, '<td valign="top">Nice wordplay, and good composition to boot.  What was your transparent object on this?</td>', 'Nice wordplay, and good composition to boot.  What was your transparent object on this?', '2002-07-07 16:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80546, 2922, 2079, '<td valign="top">This was just a simple shot through a vase of water. I used back-lighting to create the shadows and did not have the patients to re-shoot the picture to get rid of the bubbles in the bottom right corner. Photoshop was not used, No motion blur. (Thank You All for taking the time to critique).</td>', 'This was just a simple shot through a vase of water. I used back-lighting to create the shadows and did not have the patients to re-shoot the picture to get rid of the bubbles in the bottom right corner. Photoshop was not used, No motion blur. (Thank You All for taking the time to critique).', '2002-07-08 01:39:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(80547, 2923, 1759, '<td valign="top">Good job! Nicely laid out backdrop. The grain is an interesting effect. I would also like to see what this looks like in color, maybe with a softfocus filter?</td>', 'Good job! Nicely laid out backdrop. The grain is an interesting effect. I would also like to see what this looks like in color, maybe with a softfocus filter?', '2002-07-01 14:42:00.000000', NULL, 1);
