(80576, 2925, 1037, '<td valign="top">Cool, I like this one a lot. I don''t know what appeals to me, maybe just the colours and the suggestion of the landscape. It''s refreshing to get a photo like this where the details are muted for a reason, when most photos on this site are so cear and sharp and blah. Very moody.</td>', 'Cool, I like this one a lot. I don''t know what appeals to me, maybe just the colours and the suggestion of the landscape. It''s refreshing to get a photo like this where the details are muted for a reason, when most photos on this site are so cear and sharp and blah. Very moody.', '2002-07-02 09:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80577, 2925, 2261, '<td valign="top">this is a great idea and would have scored higher if the view outside was more interesting.</td>', 'this is a great idea and would have scored higher if the view outside was more interesting.', '2002-07-02 15:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
