(80580, 2925, 509, '<td valign="top">I like the blues here, but the shot itself isn''t all that interesting.  It might have fit better with the "On the road" challenge</td>', 'I like the blues here, but the shot itself isn''t all that interesting.  It might have fit better with the "On the road" challenge', '2002-07-05 16:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80581, 2925, 1054, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the sky through the window, but I wish you''d had a better location to shoot this from as the power lines and streetlights are not a very compelling backdrop.</td>', 'Nice capture of the sky through the window, but I wish you''d had a better location to shoot this from as the power lines and streetlights are not a very compelling backdrop.', '2002-07-07 16:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80582, 2925, 142, '<td valign="top">Nicely executed.  It is enough to make me want to crawl back into bed and sleep through the day.</td>', 'Nicely executed.  It is enough to make me want to crawl back into bed and sleep through the day.', '2002-07-07 23:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80583, 2925, 2172, '<td valign="top">Apologies for not commenting earlier...<br/>I like this photo very much, very crisp and clear and good dof - I like the one drop running diagonally down.  A job very well done!   (thought it would''ve scored higher)</td>', 'Apologies for not commenting earlier...I like this photo very much, very crisp and clear and good dof - I like the one drop running diagonally down.  A job very well done!   (thought it would''ve scored higher)', '2002-07-08 15:24:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(80584, 2925, 1779, '<td valign="top">Thanks Red. I liked it too. The rain drops were so big that day. It hasn''t rained like that again. <br/><br/>Although I agree with some of you that said that what''s behind isn''t that interesting... maybe I should''ve try to shoot just the sky.<br/><br/>Thanks again.<br/><br/></td>', 'Thanks Red. I liked it too. The rain drops were so big that day. It hasn''t rained like that again. Although I agree with some of you that said that what''s behind isn''t that interesting... maybe I should''ve try to shoot just the sky.Thanks again.', '2002-07-10 11:47:00.000000', NULL, 0),
