(80619, 2932, 1143, '<td valign="top">I really like this. The blue is distracting though. Need either more or less of it. There are also a couple of reflections (left bottom and right center) that detract. Nice work though.</td>', 'I really like this. The blue is distracting though. Need either more or less of it. There are also a couple of reflections (left bottom and right center) that detract. Nice work though.', '2002-07-01 03:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80620, 2932, 693, '<td valign="top">This is very original.  I really like the colours and dof.  The composition is slightly off... one minor improvement would have been to crop out the small white leaf in the lower left corner thereby allowing more of the flower on the far right to be captured.  This would have also shifted the two centre flowers more towards the left.</td>', 'This is very original.  I really like the colours and dof.  The composition is slightly off... one minor improvement would have been to crop out the small white leaf in the lower left corner thereby allowing more of the flower on the far right to be captured.  This would have also shifted the two centre flowers more towards the left.', '2002-07-01 04:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80621, 2932, 2460, '<td valign="top">I like the poem.</td>', 'I like the poem.', '2002-07-01 10:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80622, 2932, 1779, '<td valign="top">nice... : )</td>', 'nice... : )', '2002-07-01 13:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80623, 2932, 772, '<td valign="top">I have thought about this photo for a while now and the only thing transparent about it is the transparency used to insert the text into the image.  It *is* transparent, but to me, the image does not show or convey transparency to me.  = 4 - jmsetzler</td>', 'I have thought about this photo for a while now and the only thing transparent about it is the transparency used to insert the text into the image.  It *is* transparent, but to me, the image does not show or convey transparency to me.  = 4 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-01 13:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80624, 2932, 1877, '<td valign="top">Very good idea! I didn''t even think of using an actual transparency sheet!! Smartie ! 8 for you!</td>', 'Very good idea! I didn''t even think of using an actual transparency sheet!! Smartie ! 8 for you!', '2002-07-01 14:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80625, 2932, 705, '<td valign="top">clever, very nice.  personally I would like the flowers to frame the poem.  good focus.  I like that the glass gives the flower petals a nice halo.</td>', 'clever, very nice.  personally I would like the flowers to frame the poem.  good focus.  I like that the glass gives the flower petals a nice halo.', '2002-07-01 18:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
