(80648, 2936, 1041, '<td valign="top">while i like the idea, i''d like to see something more in focus in this shot.  also, the tripod doesn''t quite fit the scene (although, mine is always standing around in the house like that, so i totally understand), and the street lights are a little too bright IMO. -- gr8photos (4)</td>', 'while i like the idea, i''d like to see something more in focus in this shot.  also, the tripod doesn''t quite fit the scene (although, mine is always standing around in the house like that, so i totally understand), and the street lights are a little too bright IMO. -- gr8photos (4)', '2002-07-02 10:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80649, 2936, 1005, '<td valign="top">Reflection and transparency both, interesting.  two things  - the double glass fuzzes the reflection a bit too much and i see vertical rainbow lines that I can''t explain, but mess with the shot, could be grain.  Photo 5 Transparency 6 total 6 swash</td>', 'Reflection and transparency both, interesting.  two things  - the double glass fuzzes the reflection a bit too much and i see vertical rainbow lines that I can''t explain, but mess with the shot, could be grain.  Photo 5 Transparency 6 total 6 swash', '2002-07-02 16:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
