(80670, 2938, 2221, '<td valign="top">It was my "fallback photo" and I knew it was a bit boring. I had another idea involving a CD but it just didn''t worked so I submitted this one.<br/>Interesting how people judged differently about meeting the challenge. Didn''t thought that this would be a question when submitting it but when I think about it you''re right. It''s really streching it a bit.<br/>Anyway, many thanks for your comments. Some are really helpful.</td>', 'It was my "fallback photo" and I knew it was a bit boring. I had another idea involving a CD but it just didn''t worked so I submitted this one.Interesting how people judged differently about meeting the challenge. Didn''t thought that this would be a question when submitting it but when I think about it you''re right. It''s really streching it a bit.Anyway, many thanks for your comments. Some are really helpful.', '2002-07-08 08:19:00.000000', NULL, 0),
