(80780, 2948, 327, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, well done. Kee</td>', 'Very nice shot, well done. Kee', '2002-07-01 19:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80781, 2948, 2146, '<td valign="top">Awww how cute</td>', 'Awww how cute', '2002-07-02 02:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80782, 2948, 885, '<td valign="top">Kind of ghostly.   I like it.</td>', 'Kind of ghostly.   I like it.', '2002-07-02 10:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80783, 2948, 641, '<td valign="top">Cute shot.. and great colors</td>', 'Cute shot.. and great colors', '2002-07-02 10:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80784, 2948, 1882, '<td valign="top">I hope she got a happy meal after you put her through that!  What an adorable subject and the expression on her face is priceless.</td>', 'I hope she got a happy meal after you put her through that!  What an adorable subject and the expression on her face is priceless.', '2002-07-03 11:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80785, 2948, 1859, '<td valign="top">that is so sweet.  She''s an angel and it''s a great shot!</td>', 'that is so sweet.  She''s an angel and it''s a great shot!', '2002-07-03 16:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80786, 2948, 1066, '<td valign="top">Absolutely the best stuff here.  The subject..the wonderful taffeta and colors.  A theme I would love to shoot myself if only I could find a subject this nice :-)  One of my 10 best this week .. hokie</td>', 'Absolutely the best stuff here.  The subject..the wonderful taffeta and colors.  A theme I would love to shoot myself if only I could find a subject this nice :-)  One of my 10 best this week .. hokie', '2002-07-03 23:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80787, 2948, 1707, '<td valign="top">a pink flower on the left of her head would match nicely</td>', 'a pink flower on the left of her head would match nicely', '2002-07-04 04:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80788, 2948, 811, '<td valign="top">I love the expression.  It looks like someone got caught playing with something they shouldn''t have.</td>', 'I love the expression.  It looks like someone got caught playing with something they shouldn''t have.', '2002-07-06 11:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80789, 2948, 1054, '<td valign="top">Very cute, and well composed.</td>', 'Very cute, and well composed.', '2002-07-07 11:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80790, 2948, 142, '<td valign="top">This is precious!</td>', 'This is precious!', '2002-07-07 22:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80791, 2948, 1897, '<td valign="top">I want to answer a few comments, but first, thanks to everyone, and I took nothing personally:<br/><br/>  My daughter was not injured or choked during the making of this, nor was it "posed".  This scarf is one my her favorite playthings.  I first tried taking photo of her sitting in a chair with this, but it did not really work.<br/><br/>  I put her on our bed, on a dark green blanket.  And I asked for her help (sounds more like hop in her language).  I laid her on the bed, and covered her in it, and just let her play. I had to do this several times, shooting hand held at 1/50th, and I got about 3 good shots out of 25 or so.<br/><br/>The other ones actually look a lot like chiffon dream.  My wife and I thought this would have more universal appeal.  BTW: it makes a nice 8x10.<br/><br/>I was really worried about this being trashed for being a baby picture, but it wasn''t.  Thanks.</td>', 'I want to answer a few comments, but first, thanks to everyone, and I took nothing personally:  My daughter was not injured or choked during the making of this, nor was it "posed".  This scarf is one my her favorite playthings.  I first tried taking photo of her sitting in a chair with this, but it did not really work.  I put her on our bed, on a dark green blanket.  And I asked for her help (sounds more like hop in her language).  I laid her on the bed, and covered her in it, and just let her play. I had to do this several times, shooting hand held at 1/50th, and I got about 3 good shots out of 25 or so.The other ones actually look a lot like chiffon dream.  My wife and I thought this would have more universal appeal.  BTW: it makes a nice 8x10.I was really worried about this being trashed for being a baby picture, but it wasn''t.  Thanks.', '2002-07-08 19:59:00.000000', NULL, 0),
