(80835, 2953, 1005, '<td valign="top">What is the transparent object?  At best, a VERY loose interpretation, as far as I can see.  I am guessing, but is your "transparency" the light streams from the stadium lights?  (too loose for me)  For example:  if this was through regular glass, prove it with water droplets or the like.  If I am wrong, I apologize now.  <br/>Photo 9 Transparency -1 total 5 swash</td>', 'What is the transparent object?  At best, a VERY loose interpretation, as far as I can see.  I am guessing, but is your "transparency" the light streams from the stadium lights?  (too loose for me)  For example:  if this was through regular glass, prove it with water droplets or the like.  If I am wrong, I apologize now.  Photo 9 Transparency -1 total 5 swash', '2002-07-02 19:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
