(80837, 2953, 2337, '<td valign="top">I think I see the challenge here... The misty/smokey air with the lights shinning thru?  Great concept, but I thought the execution missed.  A closer crop without so much sky and that light in the lower right might have been a more interesting shot.  But that''s just me :)</td>', 'I think I see the challenge here... The misty/smokey air with the lights shinning thru?  Great concept, but I thought the execution missed.  A closer crop without so much sky and that light in the lower right might have been a more interesting shot.  But that''s just me :)', '2002-07-03 18:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
