(80885, 2961, 1856, '<td valign="top">good idea but IMO it would have been better implemented against a solid background...the brick and foliage are distracting.</td>', 'good idea but IMO it would have been better implemented against a solid background...the brick and foliage are distracting.', '2002-07-01 17:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80886, 2961, 327, '<td valign="top">This is okay, would of done better [IMHO] if the the backgound was less distracting. I know it''s a pain and would mean setting something up....! The colors are good and it''s interesting. Keep clicking. Kee</td>', 'This is okay, would of done better [IMHO] if the the backgound was less distracting. I know it''s a pain and would mean setting something up....! The colors are good and it''s interesting. Keep clicking. Kee', '2002-07-01 19:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80887, 2961, 1005, '<td valign="top">Good question, I can''t tell (see title, joke)  Nice shot.  I like how the edges of the thermometer cut off the temp bulbs, very interesting.  Lots of interest, good focus and lots of great color.  Photo 9 Transparency 9 total 9 swash</td>', 'Good question, I can''t tell (see title, joke)  Nice shot.  I like how the edges of the thermometer cut off the temp bulbs, very interesting.  Lots of interest, good focus and lots of great color.  Photo 9 Transparency 9 total 9 swash', '2002-07-01 19:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80888, 2961, 1759, '<td valign="top">This is really cool, but the background takes away from it. A solid white would probably have worked well here. Good job in all other respects.</td>', 'This is really cool, but the background takes away from it. A solid white would probably have worked well here. Good job in all other respects.', '2002-07-01 19:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80889, 2961, 2140, '<td valign="top">different and good. i like the idea, but it feels like somethings missing. i think the background is out of place.</td>', 'different and good. i like the idea, but it feels like somethings missing. i think the background is out of place.', '2002-07-01 21:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80890, 2961, 1667, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see this taken up closer.  Still nice.</td>', 'I would have liked to see this taken up closer.  Still nice.', '2002-07-01 21:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80891, 2961, 2154, '<td valign="top">rather intriguing composition</td>', 'rather intriguing composition', '2002-07-01 21:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80892, 2961, 1944, '<td valign="top">A fun idea, but a little busy. I think I would have made the backgroung a bit more plain to focus attention on the theometer.</td>', 'A fun idea, but a little busy. I think I would have made the backgroung a bit more plain to focus attention on the theometer.', '2002-07-01 23:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80893, 2961, 436, '<td valign="top">I love these thermometers.  The outdoors as a background was distracting and the distortion from the curvature detrated (for me) from a lovely concept.</td>', 'I love these thermometers.  The outdoors as a background was distracting and the distortion from the curvature detrated (for me) from a lovely concept.', '2002-07-02 11:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80894, 2961, 772, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo.  The only thing I don''t like about it is the background.  The outside light does help this photo quite a bit, but you may have considered holding up a dark or a light cloth behind the thermometer to remove some of the background... good shot :) = 8 - jmsetzler</td>', 'I really like this photo.  The only thing I don''t like about it is the background.  The outside light does help this photo quite a bit, but you may have considered holding up a dark or a light cloth behind the thermometer to remove some of the background... good shot :) = 8 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-02 17:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80895, 2961, 674, '<td valign="top">Too busy Back ground detracts from this shot  semi-transparent 9 distortion 8 colors in objects 9 Be creative 6 <br/>Still gave a 7</td>', 'Too busy Back ground detracts from this shot  semi-transparent 9 distortion 8 colors in objects 9 Be creative 6 Still gave a 7', '2002-07-03 02:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80896, 2961, 1041, '<td valign="top">i love the idea.  things that i would''ve considered doing differently during the execution are: a neutral background, making sure your horizon is level.  just a tad less direct light so that the top is not quite as bright. -- gr8photos (5)</td>', 'i love the idea.  things that i would''ve considered doing differently during the execution are: a neutral background, making sure your horizon is level.  just a tad less direct light so that the top is not quite as bright. -- gr8photos (5)', '2002-07-03 17:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80897, 2961, 917, '<td valign="top">You need to change the background. Try it with sky, or a ''field'' of colours.<br/></td>', 'You need to change the background. Try it with sky, or a ''field'' of colours.', '2002-07-05 11:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80898, 2961, 2172, '<td valign="top">Great idea and good photography.  One suggestion - Cropping more to just one of the bubbles could have made a strong abstract - or at least cropping out the sides.  Good work!<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Great idea and good photography.  One suggestion - Cropping more to just one of the bubbles could have made a strong abstract - or at least cropping out the sides.  Good work!Ruthann', '2002-07-05 13:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80899, 2961, 1054, '<td valign="top">I love those thermometers!  Excellent shot, the only thing that might have made it better is if you had cropped to 640x427 instead of 640x480.  Also, the image (or at least the thermometer) seems tilted slightly counterclockwise.</td>', 'I love those thermometers!  Excellent shot, the only thing that might have made it better is if you had cropped to 640x427 instead of 640x480.  Also, the image (or at least the thermometer) seems tilted slightly counterclockwise.', '2002-07-07 10:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
