(80920, 2965, 1005, '<td valign="top">Whao baby!  This is nearly too busy.  Good restraint.  Funky ice cubes.  I like the reflections around the upper edge of the glass.  (fake flowers? slightly tacky)  Photo 9 Transparency 8 total 8 swash</td>', 'Whao baby!  This is nearly too busy.  Good restraint.  Funky ice cubes.  I like the reflections around the upper edge of the glass.  (fake flowers? slightly tacky)  Photo 9 Transparency 8 total 8 swash', '2002-07-02 17:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
