(80922, 2965, 1759, '<td valign="top">Very good job on this one! I like your bold color combinations and lighting. Good job on getting the shape of the ice to project. Just the one blown out ice cube, but even that is not too bad. If you had real flowers and a bee flying around I would throw in a bonus point!</td>', 'Very good job on this one! I like your bold color combinations and lighting. Good job on getting the shape of the ice to project. Just the one blown out ice cube, but even that is not too bad. If you had real flowers and a bee flying around I would throw in a bonus point!', '2002-07-02 20:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
