(80973, 2967, 1759, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, it is well exposed, well composed, and has good color, focus, and DOF. One suggestion (maybe you tried this and it didn''t look good?) is to add a third disc in the middle to set up a series of repeating elements. Very nice work on this photo.</td>', 'Cool shot, it is well exposed, well composed, and has good color, focus, and DOF. One suggestion (maybe you tried this and it didn''t look good?) is to add a third disc in the middle to set up a series of repeating elements. Very nice work on this photo.', '2002-07-02 22:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(80974, 2967, 1005, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting, different approach to this challenge.  Credit for creative thinking.  Shot well taken.  Now for the bad stuff.  This could easily be considered using someone else''s materiel as your subject (against site rules), but on the plus side, you "give credit" to the Discovery Channel, so this might be acceptable.  Next, as a "creative" approach, it''s great, but my personal guidelines for this challenge cannot accept this as the challenge intent (IMO).  <br/><br/>After much thought, I am going to give you a 5 and not recommend for DQ.  Remember, this is just one idiot''s thoughts.  Don''t let it get to you.  Swash</td>', 'This is an interesting, different approach to this challenge.  Credit for creative thinking.  Shot well taken.  Now for the bad stuff.  This could easily be considered using someone else''s materiel as your subject (against site rules), but on the plus side, you "give credit" to the Discovery Channel, so this might be acceptable.  Next, as a "creative" approach, it''s great, but my personal guidelines for this challenge cannot accept this as the challenge intent (IMO).  After much thought, I am going to give you a 5 and not recommend for DQ.  Remember, this is just one idiot''s thoughts.  Don''t let it get to you.  Swash', '2002-07-03 14:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
