(80985, 2969, 1041, '<td valign="top">i tried very hard to figure this shot out.  you seem to have taken it through a blue glass container (glass, vase, bowl kind of thing).  i think i see a hand at the bottom right, but i''m not sure.  are the two hot spots from a flash?  or are they something else that is supposed to be there.  if it''s the flash, was there a way to turn it off and still have enough lighting?  all in all, unfortunately, i feel this is too abstract for me - i would like to recognize a little more than i can at this point.  (gr8photos - 2)</td>', 'i tried very hard to figure this shot out.  you seem to have taken it through a blue glass container (glass, vase, bowl kind of thing).  i think i see a hand at the bottom right, but i''m not sure.  are the two hot spots from a flash?  or are they something else that is supposed to be there.  if it''s the flash, was there a way to turn it off and still have enough lighting?  all in all, unfortunately, i feel this is too abstract for me - i would like to recognize a little more than i can at this point.  (gr8photos - 2)', '2002-07-01 15:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
