(81044, 2972, 2221, '<td valign="top">wow! this is a great photo! I like it very much. nice colors. perfect DOF. because the edges are blurred and the center is very sharp the photo look like it was zoomed in and/or the raindrops are falling towards the camera. nice effect! very creative.<br/></td>', 'wow! this is a great photo! I like it very much. nice colors. perfect DOF. because the edges are blurred and the center is very sharp the photo look like it was zoomed in and/or the raindrops are falling towards the camera. nice effect! very creative.', '2002-07-06 21:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
