(81046, 2972, 1054, '<td valign="top">Great idea and very good execution.  I would have liked this better if the "real" flower were more in focus -- not perfect focus, but a soft focus like in the flag shot.  Still, excellent work.</td>', 'Great idea and very good execution.  I would have liked this better if the "real" flower were more in focus -- not perfect focus, but a soft focus like in the flag shot.  Still, excellent work.', '2002-07-07 13:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
