(81063, 2974, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a great concept and I love the composition of this photo.  My problem with this image is that the focus is sharp on the reflection underneath the main subject rather than on the subject itself.  Hmmm... Two possibilities here... I would have either increased the depth of field to bring everything into sharp focus or I would have sharp focused on the main subject. - 6 - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is a great concept and I love the composition of this photo.  My problem with this image is that the focus is sharp on the reflection underneath the main subject rather than on the subject itself.  Hmmm... Two possibilities here... I would have either increased the depth of field to bring everything into sharp focus or I would have sharp focused on the main subject. - 6 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-02 13:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
