(81098, 2977, 1041, '<td valign="top">what is this,some kind of a bowl or vase?  i bet it looks cool from a more traditional angle.  it also looks cool from this angle, but i think it could''ve benefitted from a little more light shining through and creating more contrast.  also, if you center your object in the middle, make sure it''s really centered (top to bottom, left to right looks fine).  -- gr8photos (4)</td>', 'what is this,some kind of a bowl or vase?  i bet it looks cool from a more traditional angle.  it also looks cool from this angle, but i think it could''ve benefitted from a little more light shining through and creating more contrast.  also, if you center your object in the middle, make sure it''s really centered (top to bottom, left to right looks fine).  -- gr8photos (4)', '2002-07-02 12:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
