(81124, 2979, 2079, '<td valign="top">The movement in this is a neat effect. Your white balance should probably have been set for incandescent to adjust to ambient color.</td>', 'The movement in this is a neat effect. Your white balance should probably have been set for incandescent to adjust to ambient color.', '2002-07-02 13:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81125, 2979, 772, '<td valign="top">This is quite interesting :)  I don''t much care for the composition of the photo but I am really impressed with the motion on the bubble and the nice sharp focus on the person behind it.  That is a really neat effect.  = 7 - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is quite interesting :)  I don''t much care for the composition of the photo but I am really impressed with the motion on the bubble and the nice sharp focus on the person behind it.  That is a really neat effect.  = 7 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-02 18:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81126, 2979, 1042, '<td valign="top">I like the motion and the colors on this. Nice job..</td>', 'I like the motion and the colors on this. Nice job..', '2002-07-03 11:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81127, 2979, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  I like the light effects around the bubble, but not so much in the background, but probably couldn''t have one without the other, so it''s a push.  Photo 8 Transparency 8 total 8 swash</td>', 'Nicely done.  I like the light effects around the bubble, but not so much in the background, but probably couldn''t have one without the other, so it''s a push.  Photo 8 Transparency 8 total 8 swash', '2002-07-03 14:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81128, 2979, 806, '<td valign="top">Too bad her face wasn''t framed in the shot better. Her chin is cut off at the bottom. The surrounding lights are distracting. Did you have enough resolution to crop in closer?</td>', 'Too bad her face wasn''t framed in the shot better. Her chin is cut off at the bottom. The surrounding lights are distracting. Did you have enough resolution to crop in closer?', '2002-07-03 17:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81129, 2979, 811, '<td valign="top">I think having the face entirely in the picture would have made this look less like you accidentally cut her chin off (I assume you did it on purpose).  I like the blurred look of the background, and I assume those little jellybean pieces of lights are other bubbles?  karmat</td>', 'I think having the face entirely in the picture would have made this look less like you accidentally cut her chin off (I assume you did it on purpose).  I like the blurred look of the background, and I assume those little jellybean pieces of lights are other bubbles?  karmat', '2002-07-06 11:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
