(81139, 2980, 806, '<td valign="top">I''m in awe! I am trying to figure this out... my guess: a long exposure - run in, stand, run out... but I don''t know how that wouldn''t leave blur lines.... Please post a how to on this! I envisioned something like this, but didn''t get past the idea to figure it out - and know I wouldn''t have figured it out! Okay.. I''m rambling. (10)</td>', 'I''m in awe! I am trying to figure this out... my guess: a long exposure - run in, stand, run out... but I don''t know how that wouldn''t leave blur lines.... Please post a how to on this! I envisioned something like this, but didn''t get past the idea to figure it out - and know I wouldn''t have figured it out! Okay.. I''m rambling. (10)', '2002-07-01 18:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
