(81165, 2981, 885, '<td valign="top">I had this idea too...the background is nice to provide the contrast to the finger.  The whole thing just doesn''t seem quite sharp though.  I don''t know if it''s your camera, or if this is a small percentage of a larger image or why...</td>', 'I had this idea too...the background is nice to provide the contrast to the finger.  The whole thing just doesn''t seem quite sharp though.  I don''t know if it''s your camera, or if this is a small percentage of a larger image or why...', '2002-07-03 11:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81166, 2981, 1005, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea.  Low excitement score.  No ideas on how to "spruce this up", but it needs more interest.  Photo 8 Transparency 8 total 8 swash</td>', 'Interesting idea.  Low excitement score.  No ideas on how to "spruce this up", but it needs more interest.  Photo 8 Transparency 8 total 8 swash', '2002-07-03 15:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81167, 2981, 509, '<td valign="top">Very original, I never would have thought about using a contact.  It looks as though you might be pushing the macro limit of your camera (slightly out of focus), but it is still a nice shot!  Good job</td>', 'Very original, I never would have thought about using a contact.  It looks as though you might be pushing the macro limit of your camera (slightly out of focus), but it is still a nice shot!  Good job', '2002-07-04 10:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
