(81170, 2982, 1202, '<td valign="top">This is what the challenge was all about, and you have captured a nice effect.   The problem I have with your picture is that it does not motivate me and that it is missing the "WOW" factor.  Otherwise a good shot.</td>', 'This is what the challenge was all about, and you have captured a nice effect.   The problem I have with your picture is that it does not motivate me and that it is missing the "WOW" factor.  Otherwise a good shot.', '2002-07-01 10:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
