(81181, 2983, 1856, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.  For this to work for me the entire butterfly would have had to been illuminated.  I''m not sure I like the ''flame dot'' in the middle.  Maybe if you''d used a flashlight instead of the candle you would have had better results.</td>', 'Nice colors.  For this to work for me the entire butterfly would have had to been illuminated.  I''m not sure I like the ''flame dot'' in the middle.  Maybe if you''d used a flashlight instead of the candle you would have had better results.', '2002-07-02 11:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
