(81190, 2984, 2494, '<td valign="top">nice depth of field and choice to angle subject.</td>', 'nice depth of field and choice to angle subject.', '2002-07-01 14:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81191, 2984, 1041, '<td valign="top">you''ve definitely met the challenge by including the view through the filter, however, i''m wondering why you took this photo at such an angle.  it looks too crooked to be unintentional, but i don''t see a reason for it being that way.  i also don''t like the blurred leaf in the foreground, it competes with the fountain for attention.  would there have been a way of taking the shot slightly further from the right, or holding the leaf out of view for the shot?  i do like the blurry background behind the fountain with the colorful dots from the flowers. (gr8photos - 4)</td>', 'you''ve definitely met the challenge by including the view through the filter, however, i''m wondering why you took this photo at such an angle.  it looks too crooked to be unintentional, but i don''t see a reason for it being that way.  i also don''t like the blurred leaf in the foreground, it competes with the fountain for attention.  would there have been a way of taking the shot slightly further from the right, or holding the leaf out of view for the shot?  i do like the blurry background behind the fountain with the colorful dots from the flowers. (gr8photos - 4)', '2002-07-01 16:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
