(81232, 2986, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very nice, itsy bitsy nit:  I don''t like the reflections off the glasses, don''t really have a good reason why, I guess as a distraction.  Good focus, compositon, and framing.  Photo 8 Transparency 7 total 8 swash</td>', 'Very nice, itsy bitsy nit:  I don''t like the reflections off the glasses, don''t really have a good reason why, I guess as a distraction.  Good focus, compositon, and framing.  Photo 8 Transparency 7 total 8 swash', '2002-07-02 16:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81233, 2986, 2302, '<td valign="top">I wish the camera was lower and looking through the cups in this one instead of just catching the reflection of light on the wall. Nice concept though = 6</td>', 'I wish the camera was lower and looking through the cups in this one instead of just catching the reflection of light on the wall. Nice concept though = 6', '2002-07-02 16:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
