(81243, 2987, 772, '<td valign="top">I know this was shot through the glass of the fish tank... which *is* transparent.. so the challenge has been met... there is also some transparency in the fins and tail of the fish, but overall, I would like to see stronger interpretations... = 4 - jmsetzler</td>', 'I know this was shot through the glass of the fish tank... which *is* transparent.. so the challenge has been met... there is also some transparency in the fins and tail of the fish, but overall, I would like to see stronger interpretations... = 4 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-01 01:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
