(81250, 2987, 1041, '<td valign="top">wow, i know acquarium shots are difficult.  good for you for taking this on.  i wish the fish was just a little sharper and didn''t have the hot spot (from flash?) on it.  -- gr8photos (4)</td>', 'wow, i know acquarium shots are difficult.  good for you for taking this on.  i wish the fish was just a little sharper and didn''t have the hot spot (from flash?) on it.  -- gr8photos (4)', '2002-07-02 13:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81251, 2987, 2261, '<td valign="top">abit boring.</td>', 'abit boring.', '2002-07-02 15:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81252, 2987, 1005, '<td valign="top">Yes, this is through a transparent object (glass), but in my interpretation of this challenge, the transparency object enhanses/blocks/changes the subject behind it.  This is a very nice photo of a guppy.  Photo 8 Transparency 4 total 6 swash</td>', 'Yes, this is through a transparent object (glass), but in my interpretation of this challenge, the transparency object enhanses/blocks/changes the subject behind it.  This is a very nice photo of a guppy.  Photo 8 Transparency 4 total 6 swash', '2002-07-02 19:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81253, 2987, 2478, '<td valign="top">yes, aquarium glass is transparent. maybe if this was lit from the top, and if the lighting was softer, this would be more interesting?</td>', 'yes, aquarium glass is transparent. maybe if this was lit from the top, and if the lighting was softer, this would be more interesting?', '2002-07-04 01:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81254, 2987, 917, '<td valign="top">Major focus problems going on here. For creatures, I sometimes find that they settle down and hold still after youve been there a few minutes. Then you can use a longer exposure and either increase focal depth or use natural light to eliminate glare.</td>', 'Major focus problems going on here. For creatures, I sometimes find that they settle down and hold still after youve been there a few minutes. Then you can use a longer exposure and either increase focal depth or use natural light to eliminate glare.', '2002-07-05 11:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81255, 2987, 1054, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  The shadow is a bit harsh, though.</td>', 'Nicely done.  The shadow is a bit harsh, though.', '2002-07-07 11:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81256, 2988, 1005, '<td valign="top">The lens has  some very distracting bubbles in it.  Maybe the face was a little toooo close?  Some digital distortion, esp. around the eye and nose.  <br/>Photo 7 Transparency 8 total 7 swash</td>', 'The lens has  some very distracting bubbles in it.  Maybe the face was a little toooo close?  Some digital distortion, esp. around the eye and nose.  Photo 7 Transparency 8 total 7 swash', '2002-07-01 20:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81257, 2988, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a neat shot... I really like your concept on this one.  I originally gave this photo a 7 but I''m gonna bump it to 8 after looking a little closer.... This is very imaginative and a well done piece :) = 8 - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is a neat shot... I really like your concept on this one.  I originally gave this photo a 7 but I''m gonna bump it to 8 after looking a little closer.... This is very imaginative and a well done piece :) = 8 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-02 16:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81258, 2988, 1313, '<td valign="top">Too close up where''s the fish?</td>', 'Too close up where''s the fish?', '2002-07-02 21:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81259, 2988, 1041, '<td valign="top">interesting idea for this challenge.  the water bubbles suggest that you are looking through a waterfilled object.  i like the bubbles.  was there a way to avoid the highlight (probably from your lighting source) and the not quite straight background cloth?  they are a little distracting in my opinion.  btw, are your eyes green?  i love green eyes! :) -- gr8photos (4)</td>', 'interesting idea for this challenge.  the water bubbles suggest that you are looking through a waterfilled object.  i like the bubbles.  was there a way to avoid the highlight (probably from your lighting source) and the not quite straight background cloth?  they are a little distracting in my opinion.  btw, are your eyes green?  i love green eyes! :) -- gr8photos (4)', '2002-07-03 17:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81260, 2988, 1054, '<td valign="top">Good subject idea, was this actually taken through a fishbowl?</td>', 'Good subject idea, was this actually taken through a fishbowl?', '2002-07-07 16:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81261, 2988, 1458, '<td valign="top">Thank you for the comments.  I have some shots without the highlight, and the cloth is invisible more or less, I prefered having the bit of cloth at the bottom and I liked the highlight *shrugs*.<br/><br/>It was taken through an approxmately 8" diameter glass globe which had some lines in it from the manufacturing process using water as a lens through a sphere caused some spherical and chromatic aberrations which i liked, but this and the lines could be mistaken for digitization problems I suppose.<br/><br/>I got the idea for this from a site with someone holding up a fresnel lens in front of their head and only their eye was on their shoulders.  I didnt have a fresnel lens or a large enough globe to do that, but I thought the distorted enlarged eye looked interesting.</td>', 'Thank you for the comments.  I have some shots without the highlight, and the cloth is invisible more or less, I prefered having the bit of cloth at the bottom and I liked the highlight *shrugs*.It was taken through an approxmately 8" diameter glass globe which had some lines in it from the manufacturing process using water as a lens through a sphere caused some spherical and chromatic aberrations which i liked, but this and the lines could be mistaken for digitization problems I suppose.I got the idea for this from a site with someone holding up a fresnel lens in front of their head and only their eye was on their shoulders.  I didnt have a fresnel lens or a large enough globe to do that, but I thought the distorted enlarged eye looked interesting.', '2002-07-09 02:02:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(199950, 2847, 4267, '<td valign="top">wow swash that''s a nice shot! great work!</td>', 'wow swash that''s a nice shot! great work!', '2003-01-25 19:37:54.000000', NULL, 0),
